[{:id "0.1" :title "传统随机游走" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.1: 传统随机游走\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-1\n:PDF_PAGE: 46\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.1 的运行结果, PDF 第 46 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-1-traditional-random-walk-page-046.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet walker;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  walker = new Walker();\n  background(255);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  walker.step();\n  walker.show();\n}\n\nclass Walker {\n  constructor() {\n    this.x = width / 2;\n    this.y = height / 2;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    point(this.x, this.y);\n  }\n\n  step() {\n    let choice = floor(random(4));\n\n    if (choice === 0) {\n      this.x++;\n    } else if (choice === 1) {\n      this.x--;\n    } else if (choice === 2) {\n      this.y++;\n    } else {\n      this.y--;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n背景只在 =setup()= 中绘制一次, 而不是在每次 =draw()= 循环中清空, 因此画布会保留随机游走的轨迹.\n\n这个随机游走者还可以有若干变化. 当前 =Walker= 的步伐只限于上、下、左、右四种. 但画布中任意像素最多有八个相邻像素, 包括四个对角方向. 如果把停留在原地也算作一种选项, 一共会有九种可能.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 0.1, 不包含和包含对角线时, 随机游走者可采用的步伐, PDF 第 47 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/figure-0-1-random-walker-neighbors-page-047.png]]\n\n要让游走者可以移动到任意相邻像素, 或原地不动, 可以从 0 到 8 中选择一个数字. 另一个写法是在 x 轴和 y 轴上分别从 -1、0、1 三种步长中选择:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nstep() {\n  let xstep = floor(random(3)) - 1;\n  let ystep = floor(random(3)) - 1;\n\n  this.x += xstep;\n  this.y += ystep;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n还可以进一步去掉 =floor()=, 直接使用 =random()= 产生的浮点数, 让每个轴的步长在 -1 到 1 的连续范围内变化:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nstep() {\n  let xstep = random(-1, 1);\n  let ystep = random(-1, 1);\n\n  this.x += xstep;\n  this.y += ystep;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这些传统随机游走变体有一个共同点: 在任意时刻, 朝某个方向迈步的概率与朝其他方向迈步的概率相等. 四种步伐时, 每种的概率为 $1/4$, 即 25%. 九种步伐时, 每种概率为 $1/9$, 约 11.1%.\n\n这正是 =random()= 的默认行为. p5.js 的随机数生成器会产生 *均匀分布*. 可以统计每个随机数被选中的次数, 再把结果画成图形来验证这种分布.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let walker;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  walker = new Walker();\n  background(255);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  walker.step();\n  walker.show();\n}\n\nclass Walker {\n  constructor() {\n    this.x = width / 2;\n    this.y = height / 2;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    point(this.x, this.y);\n  }\n\n  step() {\n    let choice = floor(random(4));\n\n    if (choice === 0) {\n      this.x++;\n    } else if (choice === 1) {\n      this.x--;\n    } else if (choice === 2) {\n      this.y++;\n    } else {\n      this.y--;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "step() {\n  let xstep = floor(random(3)) - 1;\n  let ystep = floor(random(3)) - 1;\n\n  this.x += xstep;\n  this.y += ystep;\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "step() {\n  let xstep = random(-1, 1);\n  let ystep = random(-1, 1);\n\n  this.x += xstep;\n  this.y += ystep;\n}\n"]]} {:id "0.2" :title "随机数分布" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.2: 随机数分布\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-2\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 48-49\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.2 的随机数频数直方图, PDF 第 48 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-2-random-number-distribution-page-048.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet randomCounts = []; // 记录每个随机数被选中的次数.\nlet total = 20;        // 计数槽总数.\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  for (let i = 0; i < total; i++) {\n    randomCounts[i] = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let index = floor(random(randomCounts.length));\n  randomCounts[index]++;\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  let w = width / randomCounts.length;\n\n  for (let x = 0; x < randomCounts.length; x++) {\n    rect(x * w, height - randomCounts[x], w - 1, randomCounts[x]);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n图中每根柱子的高度略有差异. 当前样本量, 即已经抽取的随机数数量, 仍然较小, 某些数字偶尔会比其他数字更频繁地出现. 随着时间推移, 如果随机数生成器足够好, 这种分布会逐渐趋于均匀.\n\n**** 伪随机数\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: pseudorandom-numbers\n:PDF_PAGE: 49\n:END:\n\n=random()= 返回的数字并非真正随机, 而是 *伪随机*. 它们来自一个模拟随机性的数学函数. 如果运行足够长时间, 函数最终会重复某种模式, 因而不再显得随机. 不过这个周期通常极长, 对本书的示例而言, =random()= 已经足够随机.\n\n**** 练习 0.1\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: exercise-0-1\n:PDF_PAGE: 49\n:END:\n\n创建一个更倾向于向下和向右移动的随机游走者. 下一节会给出解法.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let randomCounts = []; // 记录每个随机数被选中的次数.\nlet total = 20;        // 计数槽总数.\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  for (let i = 0; i < total; i++) {\n    randomCounts[i] = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let index = floor(random(randomCounts.length));\n  randomCounts[index]++;\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  let w = width / randomCounts.length;\n\n  for (let x = 0; x < randomCounts.length; x++) {\n    rect(x * w, height - randomCounts[x], w - 1, randomCounts[x]);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "0.3" :title "倾向向右移动的游走者" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.3: 倾向向右移动的游走者\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-3\n:PDF_PAGE: 52\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.3 的运行结果, PDF 第 52 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-3-right-biased-walker-page-052.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nstep() {\n  let r = random(1);\n\n  if (r < 0.4) {\n    this.x++;       // 40% 的概率向右.\n  } else if (r < 0.6) {\n    this.x--;\n  } else if (r < 0.8) {\n    this.y++;\n  } else {\n    this.y--;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这种技巧还经常用于控制偶发事件. 假设一个草图原本每隔 100 帧创建一个新的随机游走者. 也可以改为每帧有 1% 的概率创建一个新游走者. 两者的长期平均结果相同, 即每 100 帧出现一次, 但后者加入了偶然性, 看起来更动态、更难预测.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "step() {\n  let r = random(1);\n\n  if (r < 0.4) {\n    this.x++;       // 40% 的概率向右.\n  } else if (r < 0.6) {\n    this.x--;\n  } else if (r < 0.8) {\n    this.y++;\n  } else {\n    this.y--;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "0.4" :title "高斯分布" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.4: 高斯分布\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-4\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 55-56\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.4, 均值 320、标准差 60 的高斯分布, PDF 第 55 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-4-gaussian-distribution-page-055.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  let x = randomGaussian(320, 60);\n\n  noStroke();\n  fill(0, 10);\n  circle(x, 120, 16);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里通过参数定制了 =randomGaussian()=. 实现同样变换的数学过程很简单: 把标准正态分布值乘以标准差, 再加上均值. 因此下面两种写法等价:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet x = randomGaussian(320, 60);\nlet x = 60 * randomGaussian() + 320;\n#+end_src\n\n多个半透明圆叠在一起后, 分布会逐渐显现. 中心区域最暗, 因为大多数值聚集在那里. 偶尔也会有圆出现在离中心更远的位置.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  let x = randomGaussian(320, 60);\n\n  noStroke();\n  fill(0, 10);\n  circle(x, 120, 16);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let x = randomGaussian(320, 60);\nlet x = 60 * randomGaussian() + 320;\n"]]} {:id "0.5" :title "接受-拒绝分布" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.5: 接受-拒绝分布\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-5\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 58-59\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.5, 接受-拒绝算法产生的非均匀分布, PDF 第 58 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-5-accept-reject-distribution-page-058.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction acceptreject() {\n  while (true) {\n    let r1 = random(1);   // 候选随机值.\n    let probability = r1;\n    let r2 = random(1);   // 资格随机值.\n\n    if (r2 < probability) {\n      return r1;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n接受-拒绝算法确实能生成自定义随机分布, 但效率不高. 当大量候选值被拒绝, 尤其当资格概率很低时, 会浪费许多计算. 第 9 章讨论遗传算法时, 会采用另一种更优的方法.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function acceptreject() {\n  while (true) {\n    let r1 = random(1);   // 候选随机值.\n    let probability = r1;\n    let r2 = random(1);   // 资格随机值.\n\n    if (r2 < probability) {\n      return r1;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "0.6" :title "Perlin 噪声游走者" :chapter 0 :org "*** 示例 0.6: Perlin 噪声游走者\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-0-6\n:PDF_PAGE: 64\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 0.6, Perlin 噪声游走者的运动轨迹, PDF 第 64 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/example-0-6-perlin-noise-walker-page-064.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Walker {\n  constructor() {\n    this.tx = 0;\n    this.ty = 10000;\n  }\n\n  step() {\n    this.x = map(noise(this.tx), 0, 1, 0, width);\n    this.y = map(noise(this.ty), 0, 1, 0, height);\n\n    this.tx += 0.01;\n    this.ty += 0.01;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个示例引入了一对新变量: =tx= 和 =ty=. 需要分别跟踪 x 坐标和 y 坐标的噪声位置. 但为什么 =tx= 从 0 开始, =ty= 却从 10000 开始?\n\n这两个数本身是任意选择的, 但让它们相隔很远是有意的. 噪声函数是确定性的: 对同一个输入位置 =t=, 它总会返回相同结果. 如果 x 和 y 在同一个 =t= 上读取噪声, 那么 x 和 y 会始终相等, 游走者只能沿对角线移动.\n\n因此, x 从噪声空间的 0 位置开始, y 从 10000 位置开始, 两者看起来就像彼此独立.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 0.7, 在一维噪声轴上使用不同偏移量生成 x 和 y, PDF 第 65 页精确提取.\n[[file:images/figure-0-7-noise-offsets-page-065.png]]\n\n严格来说, 这里并没有真正的时间. \"时间\" 只是理解噪声函数的一种比喻. 实际上面对的是一维 *空间*: 噪声值沿一条线排列, 程序从特定 x 位置取值. 因此很多示例会把变量命名为 =xoff=, 表示噪声图上的 x 偏移量, 而不是用 =t= 表示时间.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Walker {\n  constructor() {\n    this.tx = 0;\n    this.ty = 10000;\n  }\n\n  step() {\n    this.x = map(noise(this.tx), 0, 1, 0, width);\n    this.y = map(noise(this.ty), 0, 1, 0, height);\n\n    this.tx += 0.01;\n    this.ty += 0.01;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.1" :title "不使用向量的反弹小球" :chapter 1 :org "*** 示例 1.1: 不使用向量的反弹小球\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-1\n:PDF_PAGE: 75\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.1 的运行结果, PDF 第 75 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-1-bouncing-ball-no-vectors-page-075.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet x = 100;\nlet y = 100;\nlet xspeed = 2.5;\nlet yspeed = 2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 根据速度移动小球.\n  x = x + xspeed;\n  y = y + yspeed;\n\n  // 检查是否碰到边界并反弹.\n  if (x > width || x < 0) {\n    xspeed = xspeed * -1;\n  }\n  if (y > height || y < 0) {\n    yspeed = yspeed * -1;\n  }\n\n  // 在位置 (x, y) 绘制小球.\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  circle(x, y, 48);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个示例建立了一个平坦的二维世界, 也就是空白画布, 其中有一个圆形 \"小球\" 四处移动. 小球具有位置和速度等属性, 代码使用多个变量表示这些属性:\n\n| 属性 | 变量名 |\n|------+--------|\n| 位置 | =x= 和 =y= |\n| 速度 | =xspeed= 和 =yspeed= |\n\n在更复杂的草图中, 还可能需要更多变量来描述小球及其环境:\n\n| 属性 | 变量名 |\n|------+--------|\n| 加速度 | =xacceleration= 和 =yacceleration= |\n| 目标位置 | =xtarget= 和 =ytarget= |\n| 风 | =xwind= 和 =ywind= |\n| 摩擦力 | =xfriction= 和 =yfriction= |\n\n每个概念, 如风、位置、加速度, 都需要两个变量. 这还只是二维世界. 在三维世界中, 每种属性都需要三个变量: 位置使用 =x=、=y=、=z=, 速度使用 =xspeed=、=yspeed=、=zspeed=, 以此类推.\n\n如果代码能够更简洁一些会怎样? 与其这样开始:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet x;\nlet y;\nlet xspeed;\nlet yspeed;\n#+end_src\n\n不如写成:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet position;\nlet speed;\n#+end_src\n\n把小球的属性视为向量, 而不是一组松散的独立数值, 就能够实现这种组织方式.\n\n第一次使用向量, 并不会立刻增加新功能, 也不会神奇地把 p5.js 草图变成完整物理仿真. 不过, 向量可以更好地组织代码, 并提供一组用于常见数学运算的方法. 在后续运动编程中, 这些运算会被反复使用.\n\n本章会长时间停留在二维空间. 这些示例通常可以轻松扩展到三维, 而且后面使用的 =p5.Vector= 类也支持三维. 但为了学习基本原理, 现在加入第三个维度只会徒增干扰.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let x = 100;\nlet y = 100;\nlet xspeed = 2.5;\nlet yspeed = 2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 根据速度移动小球.\n  x = x + xspeed;\n  y = y + yspeed;\n\n  // 检查是否碰到边界并反弹.\n  if (x > width || x < 0) {\n    xspeed = xspeed * -1;\n  }\n  if (y > height || y < 0) {\n    yspeed = yspeed * -1;\n  }\n\n  // 在位置 (x, y) 绘制小球.\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  circle(x, y, 48);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let x;\nlet y;\nlet xspeed;\nlet yspeed;\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let position;\nlet speed;\n"]]} {:id "1.2" :title "使用向量的反弹小球" :chapter 1 :org "*** 示例 1.2: 使用向量的反弹小球\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-2\n:PDF_PAGE: 83\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.2 的运行结果, PDF 第 83 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-2-bouncing-ball-with-vectors-page-083.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet position;\nlet velocity;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  // createVector() 必须在 setup() 内调用.\n  position = createVector(100, 100);\n  velocity = createVector(2.5, 2);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  position.add(velocity);\n\n  if (position.x > width || position.x < 0) {\n    velocity.x = velocity.x * -1;\n  }\n  if (position.y > height || position.y < 0) {\n    velocity.y = velocity.y * -1;\n  }\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  circle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这一阶段可能会令人失望. 改写后的代码看起来甚至比原版更复杂. 这是合理的批评, 因为向量编程的力量还没有真正显现. 只观察一个反弹小球, 而且只使用向量加法, 仅仅是第一步. 当后面进入多个对象与多种力共同作用的复杂世界时, 向量的优势会逐渐清晰.\n\n虽然使用 =p5.Vector= 把位置的 x、y 和速度的 x、y 封装到一个变量中, 仍然经常需要单独访问各分量.\n\n例如, =circle()= 不接受 =p5.Vector= 对象作为位置参数. 它需要两个标量坐标:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// 不能工作.\ncircle(position, 48);\n\n// 使用点语法读取向量分量.\ncircle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n#+end_src\n\n检查是否碰到画布边缘时也一样:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nif (position.x > width || position.x < 0) {\n  velocity.x = velocity.x * -1;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n什么时候直接访问对象属性, 什么时候把对象作为整体使用, 什么时候调用对象方法, 一开始未必显而易见. 本章和后续章节会通过大量示例帮助你区分这些场景.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let position;\nlet velocity;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  // createVector() 必须在 setup() 内调用.\n  position = createVector(100, 100);\n  velocity = createVector(2.5, 2);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  position.add(velocity);\n\n  if (position.x > width || position.x < 0) {\n    velocity.x = velocity.x * -1;\n  }\n  if (position.y > height || position.y < 0) {\n    velocity.y = velocity.y * -1;\n  }\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  circle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "// 不能工作.\ncircle(position, 48);\n\n// 使用点语法读取向量分量.\ncircle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "if (position.x > width || position.x < 0) {\n  velocity.x = velocity.x * -1;\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.3" :title "向量减法" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.3: 向量减法\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-3\n:PDF_PAGE: 87\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.3 的运行结果, PDF 第 87 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-3-vector-subtraction-page-087.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 一个向量表示鼠标位置, 另一个表示画布中心.\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  // 绘制原始两个位置向量.\n  stroke(200);\n  strokeWeight(4);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n  line(0, 0, center.x, center.y);\n\n  // 向量减法.\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  // 移动原点, 再绘制减法结果.\n  stroke(0);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n注意这里使用 =translate()= 把结果向量绘制为从画布中心指向鼠标的线. 向量减法本身可以理解为一种原点平移. 从鼠标位置向量减去中心位置向量, 等价于把结果向量的起点移到画布中心. 因此绘图时也需要用 =translate()= 移动画布坐标原点. 如果不这样做, 结果线会从左上角开始, 视觉关系就不够清楚.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 一个向量表示鼠标位置, 另一个表示画布中心.\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  // 绘制原始两个位置向量.\n  stroke(200);\n  strokeWeight(4);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n  line(0, 0, center.x, center.y);\n\n  // 向量减法.\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  // 移动原点, 再绘制减法结果.\n  stroke(0);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.4" :title "向量乘法" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.4: 向量乘法\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-4\n:PDF_PAGE: 89\n:END:\n\n示例 1.4 先绘制从画布中心指向鼠标的向量, 然后把它乘以 0.5, 绘制缩放后的向量.\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.4 的运行结果, PDF 第 89 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-4-multiplying-vector-page-089.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  stroke(200);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n\n  // 向量缩小为原来的一半.\n  mouse.mult(0.5);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(4);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n结果向量长度是原来的二分之一. 除了乘以 0.5, 也可以除以 2 得到相同效果.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 1.10, 用除法缩放向量. PDF 第 90 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-1-10-vector-division-page-090.png]]\n\n向量除法和乘法类似, 只需把乘号换成除号. =p5.Vector= 的 =div()= 可以理解为:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\ndiv(n) {\n  this.x = this.x / n;\n  this.y = this.y / n;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n使用方式:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet u = createVector(8, -4);\nu.div(2);\n// u 现在等于 (4, -2), 长度减半.\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  stroke(200);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n\n  // 向量缩小为原来的一半.\n  mouse.mult(0.5);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(4);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "div(n) {\n  this.x = this.x / n;\n  this.y = this.y / n;\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let u = createVector(8, -4);\nu.div(2);\n// u 现在等于 (4, -2), 长度减半.\n"]]} {:id "1.5" :title "向量大小" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.5: 向量大小\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-5\n:PDF_PAGE: 92\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.5 的运行结果, PDF 第 92 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-5-vector-magnitude-page-092.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  // mag() 返回向量长度.\n  let m = mouse.mag();\n\n  fill(0);\n  rect(0, 0, m, 10);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n即使向量分量是负数, 向量的大小也始终为非负数.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  // mag() 返回向量长度.\n  let m = mouse.mag();\n\n  fill(0);\n  rect(0, 0, m, 10);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.6" :title "向量归一化" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.6: 向量归一化\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-6\n:PDF_PAGE: 94\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.6 的运行结果, PDF 第 94 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-6-normalizing-vector-page-094.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  // 绘制原始向量.\n  stroke(200);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n\n  // 归一化后再缩放到长度 50.\n  mouse.normalize();\n  mouse.mult(50);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(8);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里先把向量归一化到长度 1, 再乘以 50. 归一化经常只是创建特定长度向量的第一步, 目标长度不一定非要是 1. 后面会反复使用这种模式.\n\n此时你可能会问: 这些向量数学究竟怎样帮助编程? 还需要一点耐心. 学习新数据结构时经常会有这种感觉. 例如, 刚接触数组时, 用数组保存几个值似乎比定义几个独立变量更麻烦. 但当对象数量变成 100、1,000 或 10,000 时, 独立变量的做法很快就会崩溃.\n\n向量也是如此. 现在看似额外的工作, 后面会得到丰厚回报. 下一章就会开始显现. 在此之前, 继续集中理解向量本身, 以及向量如何改变思考运动的方式.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  let center = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n  mouse.sub(center);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  // 绘制原始向量.\n  stroke(200);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n\n  // 归一化后再缩放到长度 50.\n  mouse.normalize();\n  mouse.mult(50);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(8);\n  line(0, 0, mouse.x, mouse.y);\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.7" :title "运动 101, 速度" :chapter 1 :org "*** 示例 1.7: 运动 101, 速度\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-7\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 97-98\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.7 的运行结果, PDF 第 97 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-7-motion-101-velocity-page-097.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet mover;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  mover = new Mover();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  mover.update();\n  mover.checkEdges();\n  mover.show();\n}\n\nclass Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(random(width), random(height));\n    this.velocity = createVector(random(-2, 2), random(-2, 2));\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    // 运动 101: 位置随速度改变.\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(2);\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 48);\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    if (this.position.x > width) {\n      this.position.x = 0;\n    } else if (this.position.x < 0) {\n      this.position.x = width;\n    }\n\n    if (this.position.y > height) {\n      this.position.y = 0;\n    } else if (this.position.y < 0) {\n      this.position.y = height;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n如果 OOP 对你还比较陌生, 这里可能有一点奇怪. 本章前面讨论了 =p5.Vector= 类, 它是创建 =position= 与 =velocity= 对象的模板. 现在这些对象又被放进另一个对象, =Mover=, 中.\n\n这其实非常正常. 对象用于保存数据和功能, 而这些数据既可以是数字, 也可以是其他对象或数组. 本书后面会反复出现这种结构. 第 4 章会创建粒子系统类, 一个 =ParticleSystem= 对象包含许多 =Particle= 对象, 每个 =Particle= 又包含若干 =p5.Vector= 对象.\n\n当前 =Mover= 构造函数没有参数, 初始位置和速度直接在构造函数中随机生成. 这样便于保持示例简单. 第 2 章会讨论给构造函数增加参数的好处.\n\n到这里, 应当已经掌握两个概念:\n\n1. 向量是什么.\n2. 怎样在对象内部使用向量保存位置和运动信息.\n\n这是很好的第一步. 不过, 示例 1.7 仍然相当乏味. 圆不会加速、不会减速, 也不会转弯. 为了模拟自然界中更丰富的运动, 还需要给类增加一个向量: *加速度*.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let mover;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  mover = new Mover();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  mover.update();\n  mover.checkEdges();\n  mover.show();\n}\n\nclass Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(random(width), random(height));\n    this.velocity = createVector(random(-2, 2), random(-2, 2));\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    // 运动 101: 位置随速度改变.\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(2);\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 48);\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    if (this.position.x > width) {\n      this.position.x = 0;\n    } else if (this.position.x < 0) {\n      this.position.x = width;\n    }\n\n    if (this.position.y > height) {\n      this.position.y = 0;\n    } else if (this.position.y < 0) {\n      this.position.y = height;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.8" :title "运动 101, 速度与恒定加速度" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.8: 运动 101, 速度与恒定加速度\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-8\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 101-102\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.8 的运行结果, PDF 第 101 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-8-constant-acceleration-page-101.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n\n    // 加速度是运动变化的关键.\n    this.acceleration = createVector(-0.001, 0.01);\n\n    // 限制速度向量的最大大小.\n    this.topSpeed = 10;\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    // 速度随加速度改变.\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.topSpeed);\n\n    // 位置随速度改变.\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 与之前相同.\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    // 与之前相同.\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n最终效果是对象向左下方落去, 逐渐加速, 直到达到最大速度.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n\n    // 加速度是运动变化的关键.\n    this.acceleration = createVector(-0.001, 0.01);\n\n    // 限制速度向量的最大大小.\n    this.topSpeed = 10;\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    // 速度随加速度改变.\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.topSpeed);\n\n    // 位置随速度改变.\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 与之前相同.\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    // 与之前相同.\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "1.9" :title "运动 101, 速度与随机加速度" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.9: 运动 101, 速度与随机加速度\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-9\n:PDF_PAGE: 103\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.9 的运行结果, PDF 第 103 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-9-random-acceleration-page-103.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nthis.acceleration = p5.Vector.random2D();\nthis.acceleration.mult(random(2));\n#+end_src\n\n必须理解, 加速度不只是 \"变快\" 或 \"变慢\". 它指速度的任何变化, 包括大小变化和方向变化. 加速度可以用来转向. 后续章节构造能够决定如何移动的对象时, 会反复使用这一点.\n\n这个示例也可以看作另一种随机游走. 不过, 它和第 0 章传统随机游走之间有一个关键区别: 被随机化的量不同.\n\n传统随机游走直接随机修改速度, 因而每一步与上一步完全独立. 示例 1.9 随机化的是加速度, 即速度的变化率, 而不是速度本身. 对象运动依赖于之前的状态: 速度依据随机加速度逐步改变. 因而运动具有连续性和流动性, 不再像原始随机游走那样生硬. 这个差别看似细微, 却会从根本上改变对象在画布中的运动方式.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "this.acceleration = p5.Vector.random2D();\nthis.acceleration.mult(random(2));\n"]]} {:id "1.10" :title "朝鼠标加速" :chapter 1 :org "**** 示例 1.10: 朝鼠标加速\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-1-10\n:PDF_PAGE: 108\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 1.10 的运行结果, PDF 第 108 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-1-10-accelerating-toward-mouse-page-108.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nupdate() {\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n\n  // 第 1 步: 计算方向.\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(mouse, this.position);\n\n  // 第 2 步: 归一化.\n  dir.normalize();\n\n  // 第 3 步: 缩放.\n  dir.mult(0.2);\n\n  // 第 4 步: 设置加速度.\n  this.acceleration = dir;\n\n  this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n  this.velocity.limit(this.topSpeed);\n  this.position.add(this.velocity);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n为什么圆到达目标后不会停下来? 因为移动对象并不知道 \"应当在目标处停止\". 它只知道目标位置, 并始终以固定强度朝目标加速, 无论距离多远. 因而它必然越过目标, 然后转向再次加速, 再次越过, 周而复始.\n\n后续章节会介绍怎样让对象在接近目标时减速, 从而平滑地抵达目标.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "update() {\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n\n  // 第 1 步: 计算方向.\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(mouse, this.position);\n\n  // 第 2 步: 归一化.\n  dir.normalize();\n\n  // 第 3 步: 缩放.\n  dir.mult(0.2);\n\n  // 第 4 步: 设置加速度.\n  this.acceleration = dir;\n\n  this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n  this.velocity.limit(this.topSpeed);\n  this.position.add(this.velocity);\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.1" :title "力" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.1: 力\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-1\n:PDF_PAGE: 123\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.1 的运行结果. 按下鼠标时施加风力. PDF 第 123 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-1-forces-page-123.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\nmover.applyForce(gravity);\n\nif (mouseIsPressed) {\n  let wind = createVector(0.1, 0);\n  mover.applyForce(wind);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n现在有两个方向和大小不同的力同时作用于 =mover=. 一个带有环境力的世界开始成形.\n\n下面加入第二个质量不同的对象. 先回顾 =Mover= 类. 它与第 1 章的版本基本相同, 新增了 =mass= 和 =applyForce()=:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.mass = 1;\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, 30);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    let f = p5.Vector.div(force, this.mass);\n    this.acceleration.add(f);\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(175);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.mass * 16);\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    if (this.position.x > width) {\n      this.position.x = width;\n      this.velocity.x *= -1;\n    } else if (this.position.x < 0) {\n      this.velocity.x *= -1;\n      this.position.x = 0;\n    }\n\n    if (this.position.y > height) {\n      this.velocity.y *= -1;\n      this.position.y = height;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个类可以创建多个对象:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet moverA = new Mover();\nlet moverB = new Mover();\n#+end_src\n\n但此时所有对象的质量都是 1, 初始位置也完全相同. 使用构造函数参数可以创建不同质量、不同初始位置的对象:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Mover {\n  constructor(x, y, mass) {\n    this.mass = mass;\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n  }\n\n  // 其他方法保持不变.\n}\n#+end_src\n\n于是可以这样初始化:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet moverA = new Mover(100, 30, 10);\nlet moverB = new Mover(400, 30, 2);\n#+end_src\n\n第一个对象质量大, 位于画布左侧; 第二个对象质量小, 位于右侧. 初始值还可以来自随机数、Perlin 噪声、网格布局或其他规则.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\nmover.applyForce(gravity);\n\nif (mouseIsPressed) {\n  let wind = createVector(0.1, 0);\n  mover.applyForce(wind);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "class Mover {\n  constructor() {\n    this.mass = 1;\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, 30);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    let f = p5.Vector.div(force, this.mass);\n    this.acceleration.add(f);\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(175);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.mass * 16);\n  }\n\n  checkEdges() {\n    if (this.position.x > width) {\n      this.position.x = width;\n      this.velocity.x *= -1;\n    } else if (this.position.x < 0) {\n      this.velocity.x *= -1;\n      this.position.x = 0;\n    }\n\n    if (this.position.y > height) {\n      this.velocity.y *= -1;\n      this.position.y = height;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let moverA = new Mover();\nlet moverB = new Mover();\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "class Mover {\n  constructor(x, y, mass) {\n    this.mass = mass;\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n  }\n\n  // 其他方法保持不变.\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let moverA = new Mover(100, 30, 10);\nlet moverB = new Mover(400, 30, 2);\n"]]} {:id "2.2" :title "作用于两个对象的力" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.2: 作用于两个对象的力\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-2\n:PDF_PAGE: 126\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.2 的运行结果. 两个不同质量的对象受到相同重力和风力. PDF 第 126 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-2-forces-two-objects-page-126.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 虚构一个重力并施加给两个对象.\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  moverA.applyForce(gravity);\n  moverB.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  // 按下鼠标时施加风力.\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    let wind = createVector(0.1, 0);\n    moverA.applyForce(wind);\n    moverB.applyForce(wind);\n  }\n\n  moverA.checkEdges();\n  moverA.update();\n  moverA.show();\n\n  moverB.checkEdges();\n  moverB.update();\n  moverB.show();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n当前代码中的每个操作都写了两遍, 一次针对 =moverA=, 一次针对 =moverB=. 对象数量增加时, 更合理的做法是使用数组和循环. 本章后面会展示这种方式, 第 4 章则会系统讨论对象数组和粒子系统.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 虚构一个重力并施加给两个对象.\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  moverA.applyForce(gravity);\n  moverB.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  // 按下鼠标时施加风力.\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    let wind = createVector(0.1, 0);\n    moverA.applyForce(wind);\n    moverB.applyForce(wind);\n  }\n\n  moverA.checkEdges();\n  moverA.update();\n  moverA.show();\n\n  moverB.checkEdges();\n  moverB.update();\n  moverB.show();\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.3" :title "按质量缩放重力" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.3: 按质量缩放重力\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-3\n:PDF_PAGE: 128\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.3 的运行结果. 重力按对象质量缩放后, 两个对象以相同加速度下落. PDF 第 128 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-3-gravity-scaled-by-mass-page-128.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n\nlet gravityA = p5.Vector.mult(gravity, moverA.mass);\nmoverA.applyForce(gravityA);\n\nlet gravityB = p5.Vector.mult(gravity, moverB.mass);\nmoverB.applyForce(gravityB);\n#+end_src\n\n两个对象现在以相同速率下落. 这里仍然把重力基础值任意设为 0.1, 但按质量缩放使它更接近地球重力的行为. 风力则不随质量缩放, 因而按下鼠标时, 小圆仍会更快向右加速.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n\nlet gravityA = p5.Vector.mult(gravity, moverA.mass);\nmoverA.applyForce(gravityA);\n\nlet gravityB = p5.Vector.mult(gravity, moverB.mass);\nmoverB.applyForce(gravityB);\n"]]} {:id "2.4" :title "加入摩擦力" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.4: 加入摩擦力\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-4\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 133-134\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.4 的运行结果. 圆受到重力、鼠标触发的风力, 以及接触底边时的摩擦力. PDF 第 133 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-4-including-friction-page-133.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 1);\n  mover.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    let wind = createVector(0.5, 0);\n    mover.applyForce(wind);\n  }\n\n  if (mover.contactEdge()) {\n    let c = 0.1;\n    let friction = mover.velocity.copy();\n    friction.mult(-1);\n    friction.setMag(c);\n    mover.applyForce(friction);\n  }\n\n  mover.bounceEdges();\n  mover.update();\n  mover.show();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n运行后, 圆最终会停下. 改变摩擦系数, 或改变 =bounceEdges()= 中每次碰撞损失的速度比例, 可以控制它停止得更快还是更慢.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 1);\n  mover.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    let wind = createVector(0.5, 0);\n    mover.applyForce(wind);\n  }\n\n  if (mover.contactEdge()) {\n    let c = 0.1;\n    let friction = mover.velocity.copy();\n    friction.mult(-1);\n    friction.setMag(c);\n    mover.applyForce(friction);\n  }\n\n  mover.bounceEdges();\n  mover.update();\n  mover.show();\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.5" :title "流体阻力" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.5: 流体阻力\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-5\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 139-140\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.5 的运行结果. 多个不同质量的对象落入液体区域并受到阻力. PDF 第 139 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-5-fluid-resistance-page-139.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet movers = [];\nlet liquid;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {\n    let mass = random(0.1, 5);\n    movers[i] = new Mover(40 + i * 70, 0, mass);\n  }\n\n  liquid = new Liquid(0, height / 2, width, height / 2, 0.1);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  liquid.show();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    if (liquid.contains(movers[i])) {\n      let dragForce = liquid.calculateDrag(movers[i]);\n      movers[i].applyForce(dragForce);\n    }\n\n    let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1 * movers[i].mass);\n    movers[i].applyForce(gravity);\n\n    movers[i].update();\n    movers[i].show();\n    movers[i].checkEdges();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  // 重新初始化草图中的移动对象.\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    let mass = random(0.1, 5);\n    movers[i] = new Mover(40 + i * 70, 0, mass);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n灰色下半区代表液体. 对象只在进入该区域后明显减速. 小质量对象减速得比大质量对象更显著, 因为同样的阻力除以较小质量会产生更大的负加速度.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let movers = [];\nlet liquid;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {\n    let mass = random(0.1, 5);\n    movers[i] = new Mover(40 + i * 70, 0, mass);\n  }\n\n  liquid = new Liquid(0, height / 2, width, height / 2, 0.1);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  liquid.show();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    if (liquid.contains(movers[i])) {\n      let dragForce = liquid.calculateDrag(movers[i]);\n      movers[i].applyForce(dragForce);\n    }\n\n    let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1 * movers[i].mass);\n    movers[i].applyForce(gravity);\n\n    movers[i].update();\n    movers[i].show();\n    movers[i].checkEdges();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  // 重新初始化草图中的移动对象.\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    let mass = random(0.1, 5);\n    movers[i] = new Mover(40 + i * 70, 0, mass);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.6" :title "吸引" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.6: 吸引\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-6\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 147-148\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.6 的运行结果. 一个移动对象围绕固定吸引对象运动. PDF 第 147 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-6-attraction-page-147.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet mover;\nlet attractor;\nlet G = 1.0;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  mover = new Mover(300, 50, 2);\n  attractor = new Attractor();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let force = attractor.attract(mover);\n  mover.applyForce(force);\n  mover.update();\n\n  attractor.show();\n  mover.show();\n}\n\nclass Attractor {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n    this.mass = 20;\n  }\n\n  attract(mover) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, mover.position);\n    let distance = force.mag();\n    distance = constrain(distance, 5, 25);\n\n    let strength =\n      (G * this.mass * mover.mass) / (distance * distance);\n\n    force.setMag(strength);\n    return force;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(175, 200);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.mass * 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n示例中圆的直径直接按质量缩放, 这不准确. 圆面积为 $\\pi r^2$. 若密度相同, 要让面积与质量成正比, 圆的半径或直径应与质量的平方根成正比.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let mover;\nlet attractor;\nlet G = 1.0;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  mover = new Mover(300, 50, 2);\n  attractor = new Attractor();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let force = attractor.attract(mover);\n  mover.applyForce(force);\n  mover.update();\n\n  attractor.show();\n  mover.show();\n}\n\nclass Attractor {\n  constructor() {\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height / 2);\n    this.mass = 20;\n  }\n\n  attract(mover) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, mover.position);\n    let distance = force.mag();\n    distance = constrain(distance, 5, 25);\n\n    let strength =\n      (G * this.mass * mover.mass) / (distance * distance);\n\n    force.setMag(strength);\n    return force;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(175, 200);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.mass * 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.7" :title "吸引多个移动对象" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.7: 吸引多个移动对象\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-7\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 149-150\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.7 的运行结果. 一个吸引对象对多个不同质量的移动对象施加引力. PDF 第 149 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-7-attraction-many-movers-page-149.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet movers = [];\nlet attractor;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    movers[i] = new Mover(\n      random(width),\n      random(height),\n      random(0.5, 3)\n    );\n  }\n\n  attractor = new Attractor();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  attractor.show();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    let force = attractor.attract(movers[i]);\n    movers[i].applyForce(force);\n    movers[i].update();\n    movers[i].show();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这只是对象数组能力的一小部分. 第 4 章讨论粒子系统时, 会进一步研究在画布中动态添加和删除对象.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let movers = [];\nlet attractor;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    movers[i] = new Mover(\n      random(width),\n      random(height),\n      random(0.5, 3)\n    );\n  }\n\n  attractor = new Attractor();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  attractor.show();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < movers.length; i++) {\n    let force = attractor.attract(movers[i]);\n    movers[i].applyForce(force);\n    movers[i].update();\n    movers[i].show();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.8" :title "两体吸引" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.8: 两体吸引\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-8\n:PDF_PAGE: 152\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.8 的运行结果. 两个物体具有相反初速度并互相吸引. PDF 第 152 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-8-two-body-attraction-page-152.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  bodyA = new Body(320, 40);\n  bodyB = new Body(320, 200);\n\n  bodyA.velocity = createVector(1, 0);\n  bodyB.velocity = createVector(-1, 0);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n更好的设计是把初始速度作为构造函数参数, 这里直接赋值只是为了快速试验不同位置和速度组合.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  bodyA = new Body(320, 40);\n  bodyB = new Body(320, 200);\n\n  bodyA.velocity = createVector(1, 0);\n  bodyB.velocity = createVector(-1, 0);\n}\n"]]} {:id "2.9" :title "n 个物体" :chapter 2 :org "*** 示例 2.9: n 个物体\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-2-9\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 154-155\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 2.9 的运行结果. 多个物体相互施加引力. PDF 第 154 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-2-9-n-bodies-page-154.png]]\n\n下面使用一种更清晰的接口: =attract()= 返回力向量, 再由目标物体调用 =applyForce()=.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet bodies = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    bodies[i] = new Body(\n      random(width),\n      random(height),\n      random(0.1, 2)\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < bodies.length; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < bodies.length; j++) {\n      if (i !== j) {\n        let force = bodies[j].attract(bodies[i]);\n        bodies[i].applyForce(force);\n      }\n    }\n\n    bodies[i].update();\n    bodies[i].show();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n对应的 =Body.attract()= 返回力, 不直接修改目标对象:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nattract(body) {\n  let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, body.position);\n  let d = constrain(force.mag(), 5, 25);\n  let strength = (G * this.mass * body.mass) / (d * d);\n  force.setMag(strength);\n  return force;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n双重循环使计算量与物体数量的平方成正比, 即 $O(n^2)$. 物体数量增大时, 模拟会显著变慢. 第 5 章会讨论空间划分、四叉树和 Barnes-Hut 算法, 它们可以降低多体引力模拟的计算成本.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let bodies = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 10; i++) {\n    bodies[i] = new Body(\n      random(width),\n      random(height),\n      random(0.1, 2)\n    );\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < bodies.length; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < bodies.length; j++) {\n      if (i !== j) {\n        let force = bodies[j].attract(bodies[i]);\n        bodies[i].applyForce(force);\n      }\n    }\n\n    bodies[i].update();\n    bodies[i].show();\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "attract(body) {\n  let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, body.position);\n  let d = constrain(force.mag(), 5, 25);\n  let strength = (G * this.mass * body.mass) / (d * d);\n  force.setMag(strength);\n  return force;\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.1" :title "使用 =rotate()= 实现角运动" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.1: 使用 =rotate()= 实现角运动\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.1, 具有角加速度的旋转指挥棒. PDF 第 161 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-1-angular-motion-page-161.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet angle = 0;                 // 角位置\nlet angleVelocity = 0;         // 角速度\nlet angleAcceleration = 0.0001; // 角加速度\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  rotate(angle);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  line(-60, 0, 60, 0);\n  circle(60, 0, 16);\n  circle(-60, 0, 16);\n\n  angleVelocity += angleAcceleration;\n  angle += angleVelocity;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里没有直接以固定值递增 =angle=. 每一帧先把 =angleAcceleration= 加到 =angleVelocity=, 再把 =angleVelocity= 加到 =angle=. 因此指挥棒从静止开始, 随后越转越快.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let angle = 0;                 // 角位置\nlet angleVelocity = 0;         // 角速度\nlet angleAcceleration = 0.0001; // 角加速度\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  rotate(angle);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  line(-60, 0, 60, 0);\n  circle(60, 0, 16);\n  circle(-60, 0, 16);\n\n  angleVelocity += angleAcceleration;\n  angle += angleVelocity;\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.2" :title "力与近似角运动" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.2: 力与近似角运动\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.2, 根据线性加速度的 x 分量驱动角运动. PDF 第 164 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-2-angular-motion-forces-page-164.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nupdate() {\n  this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n  this.position.add(this.velocity);\n\n  this.angleAcceleration = this.acceleration.x / 10.0;\n  this.angleVelocity += this.angleAcceleration;\n  this.angleVelocity = constrain(this.angleVelocity, -0.1, 0.1);\n  this.angle += this.angleVelocity;\n\n  this.acceleration.mult(0);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里采用了两层控制. 首先将 =acceleration.x= 除以 10, 然后把 =angleVelocity= 限制在 $[-0.1,0.1]$ 范围内.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "update() {\n  this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n  this.position.add(this.velocity);\n\n  this.angleAcceleration = this.acceleration.x / 10.0;\n  this.angleVelocity += this.angleAcceleration;\n  this.angleVelocity = constrain(this.angleVelocity, -0.1, 0.1);\n  this.angle += this.angleVelocity;\n\n  this.acceleration.mult(0);\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.3" :title "指向运动方向" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.3: 指向运动方向\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.3, 让矩形朝向速度向量的方向. PDF 第 169 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-3-pointing-direction-motion-page-169.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nshow() {\n  let angle = atan2(this.velocity.y, this.velocity.x);\n\n  push();\n  rectMode(CENTER);\n  translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n  rotate(angle);\n  rect(0, 0, 30, 10);\n  pop();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=p5.Vector= 还提供 =heading()=, 内部已经调用 =atan2()=, 直接返回二维向量的方向角:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet angle = this.velocity.heading();\n#+end_src\n\n因此实际代码通常不必亲自调用三角函数, 但理解背后的计算仍然很重要.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "show() {\n  let angle = atan2(this.velocity.y, this.velocity.x);\n\n  push();\n  rectMode(CENTER);\n  translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n  rotate(angle);\n  rect(0, 0, 30, 10);\n  pop();\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let angle = this.velocity.heading();\n"]]} {:id "3.4" :title "从极坐标转换为笛卡尔坐标" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.4: 从极坐标转换为笛卡尔坐标\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.4, 通过极坐标控制圆周运动. PDF 第 172 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-4-polar-to-cartesian-page-172.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet r;\nlet theta;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  r = height * 0.45;\n  theta = 0;\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  let x = r * cos(theta);\n  let y = r * sin(theta);\n\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  line(0, 0, x, y);\n  circle(x, y, 48);\n\n  theta += 0.02;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=p5.Vector= 的静态方法 =fromAngle()= 可以直接创建指向给定角度的单位向量:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet position = p5.Vector.fromAngle(theta);\nposition.mult(r);\ncircle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n#+end_src\n\n这里 =fromAngle(theta)= 负责方向, =mult(r)= 负责半径, 共同完成极坐标到笛卡尔坐标的转换.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let r;\nlet theta;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  r = height * 0.45;\n  theta = 0;\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n\n  let x = r * cos(theta);\n  let y = r * sin(theta);\n\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  line(0, 0, x, y);\n  circle(x, y, 48);\n\n  theta += 0.02;\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let position = p5.Vector.fromAngle(theta);\nposition.mult(r);\ncircle(position.x, position.y, 48);\n"]]} {:id "3.5" :title "简谐运动 I" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.5: 简谐运动 I\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.5, 使用明确的振幅与周期实现简谐运动. 图像与图 3.11 相同, PDF 第 177 页引用同一原图.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-3-11-oscillating-circle-page-175.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let period = 120;\n  let amplitude = 200;\n  let x = amplitude * sin(TWO_PI * frameCount / period);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, x, 0);\n  circle(x, 0, 48);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n另一个相关概念是 *频率*, frequency, 即单位时间内完成的周期数. 频率是周期的倒数. 周期为 120 帧时, 每一帧完成 $1/120$ 个周期, 因而频率为 $1/120$ 周期/帧.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let period = 120;\n  let amplitude = 200;\n  let x = amplitude * sin(TWO_PI * frameCount / period);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  line(0, 0, x, 0);\n  circle(x, 0, 48);\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.6" :title "简谐运动 II" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.6: 简谐运动 II\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.6, 通过角速度递增相位实现简谐运动. PDF 第 179 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-6-simple-harmonic-motion-ii-page-179.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet angle = 0;\nlet angleVelocity = 0.05;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let amplitude = 200;\n  let x = amplitude * sin(angle);\n  angle += angleVelocity;\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  line(0, 0, x, 0);\n  circle(x, 0, 48);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n虽然代码不再显式使用 =period=, 周期仍然存在. 角速度越大, 振荡越快, 周期越短. 相位增长 $2\\pi$ 所需的帧数就是周期:\n\n\\[\n\\mathrm{period}=\\frac{2\\pi}{\\mathrm{angular\\ velocity}}\n\\]\n\n接下来创建 =Oscillator= 类, 让对象在 x 轴和 y 轴上独立振荡. 每个方向都需要角度、角速度和振幅. =p5.Vector= 可以方便地把每一对数值放在一起. 这里向量的 x、y 属性不再表示空间坐标, 只是两个独立振荡器的参数容器.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let angle = 0;\nlet angleVelocity = 0.05;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let amplitude = 200;\n  let x = amplitude * sin(angle);\n  angle += angleVelocity;\n\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127);\n  line(0, 0, x, 0);\n  circle(x, 0, 48);\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.7" :title "振荡器对象" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.7: 振荡器对象\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.7, 在 x、y 两个方向独立振荡的一组对象. PDF 第 181 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-7-oscillator-objects-page-181.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Oscillator {\n  constructor() {\n    this.angle = createVector();\n    this.angleVelocity = createVector(\n      random(-0.05, 0.05),\n      random(-0.05, 0.05)\n    );\n    this.amplitude = createVector(\n      random(20, width / 2),\n      random(20, height / 2)\n    );\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.angle.add(this.angleVelocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let x = sin(this.angle.x) * this.amplitude.x;\n    let y = sin(this.angle.y) * this.amplitude.y;\n\n    push();\n    translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    line(0, 0, x, y);\n    circle(x, y, 32);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n单独观察任意一个振荡器, 它会在水平方向规则往返, 同时在垂直方向以另一种节奏上下运动. 随机初始化的角速度和振幅使每个对象拥有不同的轨迹.\n\n这里 =this.angle=、=this.angleVelocity= 和 =this.amplitude= 的 x、y 属性只是存放两个振荡过程的对应参数. 真正的空间位置在 =show()= 中才由正弦计算出来.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Oscillator {\n  constructor() {\n    this.angle = createVector();\n    this.angleVelocity = createVector(\n      random(-0.05, 0.05),\n      random(-0.05, 0.05)\n    );\n    this.amplitude = createVector(\n      random(20, width / 2),\n      random(20, height / 2)\n    );\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.angle.add(this.angleVelocity);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let x = sin(this.angle.x) * this.amplitude.x;\n    let y = sin(this.angle.y) * this.amplitude.y;\n\n    push();\n    translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    line(0, 0, x, y);\n    circle(x, y, 32);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.8" :title "静态波" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.8: 静态波\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.8, 由一系列圆组成的静态正弦波. PDF 第 183 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-8-static-wave-page-183.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet angle = 0;\nlet deltaAngle = 0.2;\nlet amplitude = 100;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  background(255);\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127, 127);\n\n  for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 24) {\n    let y = amplitude * sin(angle);\n    circle(x, y + height / 2, 48);\n    angle += deltaAngle;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=deltaAngle= 越大, 相邻采样点之间的相位变化越大, 波长越短. 当波长很短而采样点又较稀疏时, 离散的圆会让波形变得难以辨认.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 3.13, deltaAngle 分别为 0.05、0.2 和 0.6 时的三条波. PDF 第 184 页中的三个内嵌图像精确提取并按原顺序合并.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-3-13-waves-varying-delta-angle-page-184.png]]\n\n示例 3.8 全部放在 =setup()= 中, 因而结果是静态的. 直接把循环移到 =draw()= 并让 =angle= 持续累加会产生跳变, 因为上一帧波形右端的相位通常不等于下一帧左端应有的起始相位.\n\n解决方法是增加一个专门表示每帧起始相位的变量 =startAngle=. 每次 =draw()= 开始时, 局部 =angle= 从 =startAngle= 出发; 完成整条波的绘制后, 再缓慢递增 =startAngle=.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let angle = 0;\nlet deltaAngle = 0.2;\nlet amplitude = 100;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  background(255);\n  stroke(0);\n  fill(127, 127);\n\n  for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 24) {\n    let y = amplitude * sin(angle);\n    circle(x, y + height / 2, 48);\n    angle += deltaAngle;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.9" :title "波动的波" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.9: 波动的波\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.9, 通过移动起始相位让整条波连续传播. 图像与图 3.12 使用同一原图, PDF 第 185 页引用.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-3-12-animated-sine-wave-page-182.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet startAngle = 0;\nlet deltaAngle = 0.2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let angle = startAngle;\n\n  for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 24) {\n    let y = map(sin(angle), -1, 1, 0, height);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127, 127);\n    circle(x, y, 48);\n    angle += deltaAngle;\n  }\n\n  startAngle += 0.02;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里将起始相位的增量写死为 0.02. 也可以复用 =deltaAngle=, 让空间变化与时间变化绑定; 或另建 =startAngleVelocity=, 独立控制波的传播速度. 由于起始角随时间变化, 使用 velocity 一词是合理的.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let startAngle = 0;\nlet deltaAngle = 0.2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let angle = startAngle;\n\n  for (let x = 0; x <= width; x += 24) {\n    let y = map(sin(angle), -1, 1, 0, height);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127, 127);\n    circle(x, y, 48);\n    angle += deltaAngle;\n  }\n\n  startAngle += 0.02;\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.10" :title "简单弹簧连接" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.10: 简单弹簧连接\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.10, 重物通过弹簧与固定锚点连接. PDF 第 192 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-10-simple-spring-connection-page-192.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Spring {\n  constructor(x, y, length) {\n    this.anchor = createVector(x, y);\n    this.restLength = length;\n    this.k = 0.2;\n  }\n\n  connect(bob) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(bob.position, this.anchor);\n    let currentLength = force.mag();\n    let stretch = currentLength - this.restLength;\n\n    force.setMag(-1 * this.k * stretch);\n    bob.applyForce(force);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.anchor.x, this.anchor.y, 10);\n  }\n\n  showLine(bob) {\n    stroke(0);\n    line(\n      bob.position.x,\n      bob.position.y,\n      this.anchor.x,\n      this.anchor.y\n    );\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n书籍网站上的完整版本还包含两项功能: =Bob= 支持鼠标拖动; =Spring= 可以把连接长度限制在最小值和最大值之间.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Spring {\n  constructor(x, y, length) {\n    this.anchor = createVector(x, y);\n    this.restLength = length;\n    this.k = 0.2;\n  }\n\n  connect(bob) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(bob.position, this.anchor);\n    let currentLength = force.mag();\n    let stretch = currentLength - this.restLength;\n\n    force.setMag(-1 * this.k * stretch);\n    bob.applyForce(force);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.anchor.x, this.anchor.y, 10);\n  }\n\n  showLine(bob) {\n    stroke(0);\n    line(\n      bob.position.x,\n      bob.position.y,\n      this.anchor.x,\n      this.anchor.y\n    );\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "3.11" :title "摆动的摆" :chapter 3 :org "*** 示例 3.11: 摆动的摆\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 3.11, 从 45 度初始角释放的摆. PDF 第 201 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-3-11-swinging-pendulum-page-201.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet pendulum;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  pendulum = new Pendulum(width / 2, 0, 175);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  pendulum.update();\n  pendulum.show();\n}\n\nclass Pendulum {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    this.pivot = createVector(x, y); // 支点位置\n    this.bob = createVector();       // 重物位置\n    this.r = r;                      // 摆臂长度\n    this.angle = PI / 4;             // 摆臂角度\n    this.angleVelocity = 0;          // 角速度\n    this.angleAcceleration = 0;      // 角加速度\n    this.damping = 0.99;             // 阻尼\n    this.ballr = 24;                 // 重物半径\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    let gravity = 0.4;\n\n    this.angleAcceleration =\n      (-1 * gravity / this.r) * sin(this.angle);\n\n    this.angleVelocity += this.angleAcceleration;\n    this.angle += this.angleVelocity;\n    this.angleVelocity *= this.damping;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    this.bob.set(\n      this.r * sin(this.angle),\n      this.r * cos(this.angle)\n    );\n    this.bob.add(this.pivot);\n\n    stroke(0);\n    line(this.pivot.x, this.pivot.y, this.bob.x, this.bob.y);\n\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.bob.x, this.bob.y, this.ballr * 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n书籍网站上的版本还允许用户用鼠标抓住摆并甩动它.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let pendulum;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  pendulum = new Pendulum(width / 2, 0, 175);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  pendulum.update();\n  pendulum.show();\n}\n\nclass Pendulum {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    this.pivot = createVector(x, y); // 支点位置\n    this.bob = createVector();       // 重物位置\n    this.r = r;                      // 摆臂长度\n    this.angle = PI / 4;             // 摆臂角度\n    this.angleVelocity = 0;          // 角速度\n    this.angleAcceleration = 0;      // 角加速度\n    this.damping = 0.99;             // 阻尼\n    this.ballr = 24;                 // 重物半径\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    let gravity = 0.4;\n\n    this.angleAcceleration =\n      (-1 * gravity / this.r) * sin(this.angle);\n\n    this.angleVelocity += this.angleAcceleration;\n    this.angle += this.angleVelocity;\n    this.angleVelocity *= this.damping;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    this.bob.set(\n      this.r * sin(this.angle),\n      this.r * cos(this.angle)\n    );\n    this.bob.add(this.pivot);\n\n    stroke(0);\n    line(this.pivot.x, this.pivot.y, this.bob.x, this.bob.y);\n\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.bob.x, this.bob.y, this.ballr * 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.1" :title "单个粒子" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.1: 单个粒子\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.1, 单个粒子. PDF 第 212 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-1-single-particle-page-212.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet particle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  particle = new Particle(width / 2, 20);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  particle.update();\n  particle.show();\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  particle.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  if (particle.isDead()) {\n    particle = new Particle(width / 2, 20);\n    console.log(\"Particle dead!\");\n  }\n}\n\nclass Particle {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    // 为了演示, 粒子具有随机初速度.\n    this.velocity = createVector(random(-1, 1), random(-2, 0));\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.lifespan = 255.0;\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.lifespan -= 2.0;\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0, this.lifespan);\n    fill(0, this.lifespan);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 8);\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 沿用前面章节中的物理模型.\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  isDead() {\n    return (this.lifespan < 0.0);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n为了保持简单并便于测试, 这个示例每次只创建一个粒子. 每当粒子的生命周期结束, =particle= 变量就会被新的 =Particle= 实例覆盖. 这等效于替换之前的 =Particle= 对象. 需要理解的是, 旧的 =Particle= 对象并不是被显式删除了, 而是不再能从代码中访问或使用. 草图实际上忘记了旧粒子, 然后用新创建的粒子重新开始.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let particle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  particle = new Particle(width / 2, 20);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  particle.update();\n  particle.show();\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  particle.applyForce(gravity);\n\n  if (particle.isDead()) {\n    particle = new Particle(width / 2, 20);\n    console.log(\"Particle dead!\");\n  }\n}\n\nclass Particle {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    // 为了演示, 粒子具有随机初速度.\n    this.velocity = createVector(random(-1, 1), random(-2, 0));\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.lifespan = 255.0;\n  }\n\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.lifespan -= 2.0;\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0, this.lifespan);\n    fill(0, this.lifespan);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 8);\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 沿用前面章节中的物理模型.\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  isDead() {\n    return (this.lifespan < 0.0);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.2" :title "粒子数组" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.2: 粒子数组\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.2, 粒子数组. PDF 第 218 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-2-array-of-particles-page-218.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet particles = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  particles.push(new Particle(width / 2, 20));\n\n  // 为了安全删除元素, 反向遍历数组.\n  for (let i = particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    let particle = particles[i];\n    particle.run();\n\n    if (particle.isDead()) {\n      particles.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n你可能会问, 为什么不在经过固定时间后直接删除最老的粒子, 而要逐个检查每个粒子? 固定时间可以通过 =frameCount= 或数组长度判断. 在本示例中, 粒子死亡的顺序与出生顺序相同, 因此这种方法确实可行. 甚至可以使用另一个数组方法 =shift()=, 它会自动删除数组的第一个元素.\n\n然而, 在许多粒子系统中, 其他条件或交互可能会导致 \"年轻\" 粒子比 \"年老\" 粒子更早死亡. 将 =isDead()= 与 =splice()= 结合使用是一种完整而灵活的方案, 能够适应多种粒子管理场景.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let particles = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  particles.push(new Particle(width / 2, 20));\n\n  // 为了安全删除元素, 反向遍历数组.\n  for (let i = particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    let particle = particles[i];\n    particle.run();\n\n    if (particle.isDead()) {\n      particles.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.3" :title "单个粒子发射器" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.3: 单个粒子发射器\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.3, 单个粒子发射器. PDF 第 221 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-3-single-particle-emitter-page-221.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    // 此实现包含一个所有粒子开始运动的原点.\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    // 原点在粒子加入数组时传递给粒子.\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(origin.x, origin.y));\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n示例中的发射器是静止的粒子源, 这是开始学习粒子系统的好方式, 但发射器并不必须静止. 它可以拥有自己的行为, 例如受到物理作用, 振荡, 响应用户输入, 或表现出前面章节介绍的任何运动. 粒子可以随时间从不同位置发出, 从而形成轨迹或其他更复杂, 更引人入胜的图案.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    // 此实现包含一个所有粒子开始运动的原点.\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    // 原点在粒子加入数组时传递给粒子.\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(origin.x, origin.y));\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.4" :title "系统的系统" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.4: 系统的系统\n\n点击鼠标会添加一个新的发射器.\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.4, 由多个粒子发射器组成的系统. PDF 第 224 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-4-system-of-systems-page-224.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// 这次数组中保存的对象本身就是粒子发射器.\nlet emitters = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  // 每次点击鼠标, 创建新的 Emitter 并加入数组.\n  emitters.push(new Emitter(mouseX, mouseY));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // emitters 中没有元素被删除, 因此可以使用 for...of.\n  for (let emitter of emitters) {\n    emitter.run();\n    emitter.addParticle();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这里重新使用了 =for...of= 循环, 因为 =emitters= 数组中没有元素会在遍历期间被移除.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "// 这次数组中保存的对象本身就是粒子发射器.\nlet emitters = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  // 每次点击鼠标, 创建新的 Emitter 并加入数组.\n  emitters.push(new Emitter(mouseX, mouseY));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // emitters 中没有元素被删除, 因此可以使用 for...of.\n  for (let emitter of emitters) {\n    emitter.run();\n    emitter.addParticle();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.5" :title "使用继承和多态的粒子系统" :chapter 4 :org "**** 示例 4.5: 使用继承和多态的粒子系统\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.5, 同一粒子数组中混合 Particle 和 Confetti. PDF 第 236 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-5-inheritance-polymorphism-page-236.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    // 一个列表可以保存 Particle 或任何扩展 Particle 的对象.\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    let r = random(1);\n\n    // 两种粒子各有 50% 概率被加入.\n    if (r < 0.5) {\n      this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n    } else {\n      this.particles.push(new Confetti(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个示例还在哪里利用了多态? 多态允许 =Particle= 和 =Confetti= 对象混合存放在 =Emitter= 类的同一个 =particles= 数组中. 由于存在继承关系, 两者都可以被视为 =Particle= 类型, 因此可以安全地遍历数组, 并对每个对象调用 =run()=, =isDead()= 等方法. 继承与多态结合后, 不同原始类的多种粒子类型都可以在同一个数组中统一管理.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    // 一个列表可以保存 Particle 或任何扩展 Particle 的对象.\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    let r = random(1);\n\n    // 两种粒子各有 50% 概率被加入.\n    if (r < 0.5) {\n      this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n    } else {\n      this.particles.push(new Confetti(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.6" :title "带力的粒子系统" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.6: 带力的粒子系统\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.6, 向发射器传递重力, 再由发射器施加给全部粒子. PDF 第 239 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-6-particle-system-forces-page-239.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet emitter;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  emitter = new Emitter(createVector(width / 2, 20));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  emitter.applyForce(gravity);\n  emitter.addParticle();\n  emitter.run();\n}\n\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 对所有粒子施加同一个力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    // 因为需要检查并删除粒子, 不能使用 for...of.\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个示例使用硬编码重力, 但值得思考前面章节中的其他力如何参与, 例如风和阻力. 还可以改变力的作用时间与作用条件. 力不必每一帧都持续作用于粒子, 它可以只在特定条件满足或特定时刻出现. 如何设计粒子系统中的力, 仍然有很大的创意和交互空间.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let emitter;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  emitter = new Emitter(createVector(width / 2, 20));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  emitter.applyForce(gravity);\n  emitter.addParticle();\n  emitter.run();\n}\n\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 对所有粒子施加同一个力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    // 因为需要检查并删除粒子, 不能使用 for...of.\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.7" :title "带排斥器的粒子系统" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.7: 带排斥器的粒子系统\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.7, 粒子系统中的排斥器. PDF 第 243 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-7-particle-system-repeller-page-243.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet emitter;  // 一个粒子发射器\nlet repeller; // 一个排斥器\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  emitter = new Emitter(width / 2, 20);\n  repeller = new Repeller(width / 2, 200);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  emitter.addParticle();\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  emitter.applyForce(gravity);\n  emitter.applyRepeller(repeller);\n\n  emitter.run();\n  repeller.show();\n}\n\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 直接施加一个 p5.Vector 力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  applyRepeller(repeller) {\n    // 根据排斥器为每个粒子分别计算力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      let force = repeller.repel(particle);\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Repeller {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.power = 150;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 32);\n  }\n\n  repel(particle) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, particle.position);\n    let distance = force.mag();\n    distance = constrain(distance, 5, 50);\n\n    let strength = -1 * this.power / (distance * distance);\n    force.setMag(strength);\n    return force;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=Repeller= 类中的 =power= 控制排斥力强度. 当系统中存在多个吸引器和排斥器, 且各自拥有不同 =power= 时, 这个属性会变得特别有趣. 例如, 强吸引器配合弱排斥器, 可能使粒子聚集在吸引器周围. 更强的排斥器则可能制造出类似通道或路径的图案. 这些现象预示着第 5 章将进一步研究的复杂系统.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let emitter;  // 一个粒子发射器\nlet repeller; // 一个排斥器\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  emitter = new Emitter(width / 2, 20);\n  repeller = new Repeller(width / 2, 200);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  emitter.addParticle();\n\n  let gravity = createVector(0, 0.1);\n  emitter.applyForce(gravity);\n  emitter.applyRepeller(repeller);\n\n  emitter.run();\n  repeller.show();\n}\n\nclass Emitter {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.origin = createVector(x, y);\n    this.particles = [];\n  }\n\n  addParticle() {\n    this.particles.push(new Particle(this.origin.x, this.origin.y));\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    // 直接施加一个 p5.Vector 力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  applyRepeller(repeller) {\n    // 根据排斥器为每个粒子分别计算力.\n    for (let particle of this.particles) {\n      let force = repeller.repel(particle);\n      particle.applyForce(force);\n    }\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    for (let i = this.particles.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let particle = this.particles[i];\n      particle.run();\n\n      if (particle.isDead()) {\n        this.particles.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Repeller {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.power = 150;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, 32);\n  }\n\n  repel(particle) {\n    let force = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, particle.position);\n    let distance = force.mag();\n    distance = constrain(distance, 5, 50);\n\n    let strength = -1 * this.power / (distance * distance);\n    force.setMag(strength);\n    return force;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.8" :title "图像纹理粒子系统" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.8: 图像纹理粒子系统\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.8, 使用模糊 PNG 纹理的烟雾粒子系统. PDF 第 247 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-8-image-texture-particle-system-page-247.png]]\n\n首先声明一个变量保存图像:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet img;\n#+end_src\n\n然后在 =preload()= 中加载图像:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction preload() {\n  img = loadImage(\"texture.png\");\n}\n#+end_src\n\n绘制粒子时, 使用 =img= 代替圆形或矩形:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nshow() {\n  imageMode(CENTER);\n  // tint() 对图像的作用类似于 fill() 对形状的作用.\n  tint(255, this.lifespan);\n  image(img, this.position.x, this.position.y);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个烟雾示例还提供了重新使用第 0 章高斯分布的好机会. 如果粒子从完全随机的方向发射, 效果更像喷泉. 若初始速度向量主要聚集在某个均值附近, 只有较低概率出现离群速度, 结果会更像烟雾.\n\n使用 =randomGaussian()= 初始化速度:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet vx = randomGaussian(0, 0.3);\nlet vy = randomGaussian(-1, 0.3);\nthis.velocity = createVector(vx, vy);\n#+end_src\n\n最后, 在示例中向烟雾施加风力. 风的方向由鼠标水平位置映射得到:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  background(0);\n\n  // 风力方向由 mouseX 决定.\n  let dx = map(mouseX, 0, width, -0.2, 0.2);\n  let wind = createVector(dx, 0);\n\n  emitter.applyForce(wind);\n  emitter.run();\n  emitter.addParticle();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n除了纹理设计, 还应考虑纹理分辨率. 大量高分辨率纹理会明显降低性能, 尤其是在代码需要动态缩放图像时. 为获得最佳速度, 理想情况是让纹理分辨率与它在画布中实际绘制的尺寸完全一致. 如果粒子尺寸不同, 最好按最大粒子尺寸制作纹理.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let img;\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "function preload() {\n  img = loadImage(\"texture.png\");\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "show() {\n  imageMode(CENTER);\n  // tint() 对图像的作用类似于 fill() 对形状的作用.\n  tint(255, this.lifespan);\n  image(img, this.position.x, this.position.y);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let vx = randomGaussian(0, 0.3);\nlet vy = randomGaussian(-1, 0.3);\nthis.velocity = createVector(vx, vy);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  background(0);\n\n  // 风力方向由 mouseX 决定.\n  let dx = map(mouseX, 0, width, -0.2, 0.2);\n  let wind = createVector(dx, 0);\n\n  emitter.applyForce(wind);\n  emitter.run();\n  emitter.addParticle();\n}\n"]]} {:id "4.9" :title "加法混合" :chapter 4 :org "*** 示例 4.9: 加法混合\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 4.9, 使用 ADD 混合模式叠加发光烟雾粒子. PDF 第 249 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-4-9-additive-blending-page-249.png]]\n\n在开始绘制任何内容之前, 使用 =blendMode()= 设置混合模式:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  // 使用加法混合.\n  blendMode(ADD);\n\n  // 加法混合不会像普通背景那样覆盖旧内容, 因此先 clear().\n  clear();\n\n  // 白色或过亮背景无法表现加法混合的发光效果.\n  background(0);\n\n  let dx = map(mouseX, 0, width, -0.2, 0.2);\n  let wind = createVector(dx, 0);\n  emitter.applyForce(wind);\n  emitter.run();\n\n  // 每帧加入三个粒子, 进一步增强叠加效果.\n  for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n    emitter.addParticle();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n加法混合与粒子系统也提供了讨论计算机图形渲染器的机会. *渲染器*, renderer, 是代码中负责在屏幕上绘图的部分. p5.js 的默认渲染器建立在现代浏览器提供的标准二维绘图和动画渲染器之上. 此前你一直在使用它, 只是可能没有意识到.\n\np5.js 还提供名为 =WEBGL= 的渲染选项. WebGL 是 Web Graphics Library 的缩写, 是浏览器中的高性能二维与三维图形渲染器. 它会使用计算机显卡提供的额外能力. 启用方式是在 =createCanvas()= 中增加第三个参数:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240, WEBGL);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n通常只有绘制三维形状时才需要 WebGL. 但在某些二维草图中, 它也可能很有价值. 具体效果取决于计算机硬件和草图细节, 有时 WebGL 能显著提升绘制性能. 粒子系统, 尤其是启用加法混合的粒子系统, 正是适合使用 WebGL 的场景. 它通常可以在不拖慢草图的情况下绘制更多粒子.\n\n需要注意, =WEBGL= 模式会改变绘图原点, 使 $(0,0)$ 位于画布中心而不是左上角. 它也会改变某些函数的行为, 可能影响渲染质量. 一些较旧设备或浏览器不支持 WebGL, 不过这种情况已经很少见. 可以在 Coding Train 的 WebGL 视频中了解更多: https://thecodingtrain.com/webgl.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  // 使用加法混合.\n  blendMode(ADD);\n\n  // 加法混合不会像普通背景那样覆盖旧内容, 因此先 clear().\n  clear();\n\n  // 白色或过亮背景无法表现加法混合的发光效果.\n  background(0);\n\n  let dx = map(mouseX, 0, width, -0.2, 0.2);\n  let wind = createVector(dx, 0);\n  emitter.applyForce(wind);\n  emitter.run();\n\n  // 每帧加入三个粒子, 进一步增强叠加效果.\n  for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n    emitter.addParticle();\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240, WEBGL);\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.1" :title "寻找目标" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.1: 寻找目标\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-1-seeking-a-target\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 262-263\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.1, 寻找目标. PDF 第 262 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-1-seeking-a-target-page-262.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Vehicle {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    // 额外的尺寸变量\n    this.r = 6.0;\n    // 最高速度和最大力使用任意初值, 可以尝试调整\n    this.maxspeed = 8;\n    this.maxforce = 0.2;\n  }\n\n  // 标准更新函数\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.maxspeed);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  // 牛顿第二定律, 省略质量计算\n  applyForce(force) {\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  // 寻找行为的转向力算法\n  seek(target) {\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 载具绘制成朝向速度方向的三角形.\n    let angle = this.velocity.heading();\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    beginShape();\n    vertex(this.r * 2, 0);\n    vertex(-this.r * 2, -this.r);\n    vertex(-this.r * 2, this.r);\n    endShape(CLOSE);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n与前几章用圆表示 mover 和 particle 不同, 这里使用 =beginShape()=, =vertex()= 和 =endShape()= 绘制三角形, 再用速度向量的 =heading()= 确定朝向. 这样可以直观看到载具正面指向哪里.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Vehicle {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    // 额外的尺寸变量\n    this.r = 6.0;\n    // 最高速度和最大力使用任意初值, 可以尝试调整\n    this.maxspeed = 8;\n    this.maxforce = 0.2;\n  }\n\n  // 标准更新函数\n  update() {\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.maxspeed);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n  }\n\n  // 牛顿第二定律, 省略质量计算\n  applyForce(force) {\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  // 寻找行为的转向力算法\n  seek(target) {\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 载具绘制成朝向速度方向的三角形.\n    let angle = this.velocity.heading();\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    beginShape();\n    vertex(this.r * 2, 0);\n    vertex(-this.r * 2, -this.r);\n    vertex(-this.r * 2, this.r);\n    endShape(CLOSE);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.2" :title "到达目标" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.2: 到达目标\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-2-arriving-at-a-target\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 267-269\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.2, 到达目标. PDF 第 267 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-2-arriving-at-a-target-page-267.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  arrive(target) {\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    // 距离等于这个向量的大小:\n    //它从当前位置指向\n    //目标位置.\n    let d = desired.mag();\n    // 如果距离小于 100 像素...\n    if (d < 100) {\n      // ...根据距离设置期望速度大小.\n      let m = map(d, 0, 100, 0, this.maxspeed);\n      desired.setMag(m);\n    } else {\n      // 否则以最高速度前进.\n      desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    }\n\n    // 常规转向力 = 期望速度 - 当前速度\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n到达行为很好地体现了自主智能体如何感知环境, 包括感知自身状态. 天体受引力吸引时并不知道自己正在受力, 但追逐猎物的猎豹知道自己在追逐. 载具既根据到目标的距离调整期望速度, 又把期望速度与当前速度比较. 转向力实际上就是当前运动的 *误差*: \"我应该以这个速度朝这个方向运动, 但现在实际速度是另一个值. 两者之差就是需要纠正的量.\"\n\n这种误差有时会让转向力指向看似意外的方向. 如果载具正以高于期望速度的速度接近目标, 为了减速, 转向力会反向指离目标.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.10, 当前速度超过期望速度时, 转向力会背离目标以实现减速. PDF 第 269 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-10-a-vehicle-moving-toward-its-target-faster-than-its-desired-velocity-will-page-269.jpg]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  arrive(target) {\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    // 距离等于这个向量的大小:\n    //它从当前位置指向\n    //目标位置.\n    let d = desired.mag();\n    // 如果距离小于 100 像素...\n    if (d < 100) {\n      // ...根据距离设置期望速度大小.\n      let m = map(d, 0, 100, 0, this.maxspeed);\n      desired.setMag(m);\n    } else {\n      // 否则以最高速度前进.\n      desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    }\n\n    // 常规转向力 = 期望速度 - 当前速度\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.3" :title "\"保持在墙内\" 转向行为" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.3: \"保持在墙内\" 转向行为\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-3-stay-within-walls\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 272-273\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.3, 保持在墙内. PDF 第 272 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-3-stay-within-walls-steering-behavior-page-272.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  // 方法接收距边缘的偏移量.\n  boundaries(offset) {\n    // 期望速度初始为 null.\n    let desired = null;\n    // 构造期望速度, 保留载具的 y 方向,\n    //同时让 x 方向直接远离\n    //画布边缘.\n    if (this.position.x < offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.maxspeed, this.velocity.y);\n    } else if (this.position.x > width - offset) {\n      desired = createVector(-this.maxspeed, this.velocity.y);\n    }\n    if (this.position.y < offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.velocity.x, this.maxspeed);\n    } else if (this.position.y > height - offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.velocity.x, -this.maxspeed);\n    }\n    // 若期望速度非 null, 则应用转向力.\n    if (desired !== null) {\n      desired.normalize();\n      desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n      let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n      steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n      this.applyForce(steer);\n    }\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n方法开始时把 =desired= 设为 =null=, 而不是零向量. 原因是转向力等于期望速度减去当前速度. 若期望速度为 0, 就会产生减速到静止的力. 使用 =null= 并只在载具接近边界时计算转向, 可以让远离墙壁的载具完全不受影响.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  // 方法接收距边缘的偏移量.\n  boundaries(offset) {\n    // 期望速度初始为 null.\n    let desired = null;\n    // 构造期望速度, 保留载具的 y 方向,\n    //同时让 x 方向直接远离\n    //画布边缘.\n    if (this.position.x < offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.maxspeed, this.velocity.y);\n    } else if (this.position.x > width - offset) {\n      desired = createVector(-this.maxspeed, this.velocity.y);\n    }\n    if (this.position.y < offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.velocity.x, this.maxspeed);\n    } else if (this.position.y > height - offset) {\n      desired = createVector(this.velocity.x, -this.maxspeed);\n    }\n    // 若期望速度非 null, 则应用转向力.\n    if (desired !== null) {\n      desired.normalize();\n      desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n      let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n      steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n      this.applyForce(steer);\n    }\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.4" :title "跟随流场" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.4: 跟随流场\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-4-flow-field-following\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 279-280\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.4, 跟随流场. PDF 第 279 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-4-flow-field-following-page-279.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  follow(flow) {\n    // 该位置的流场向量是什么?\n    let desired = flow.lookup(this.position);\n    desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    // 转向力等于期望速度减去当前速度.\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n=lookup()= 放在 =FlowField= 中而不是 =Vehicle= 中, 是因为查询动作天然依赖流场自身的数据结构, 这符合封装原则. 本例还使用载具数组. 虽然每个载具独立行动, 但这已经为后面的群体行为搭好了舞台.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  follow(flow) {\n    // 该位置的流场向量是什么?\n    let desired = flow.lookup(this.position);\n    desired.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n    // 转向力等于期望速度减去当前速度.\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired, this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    this.applyForce(steer);\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.5" :title "创建路径对象" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.5: 创建路径对象\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-5-creating-a-path-object\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 285-286\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.5, 创建路径对象. PDF 第 285 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-5-creating-a-path-object-page-285.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Path {\n  constructor() {\n    // 路径具有表示宽度的半径.\n    this.radius = 20;\n    // 路径只有起点和终点两个点.\n    this.start = createVector(0, height / 3);\n    this.end = createVector(width, (2 * height) / 3);\n  }\n\n  // 绘制路径.\n  show() {\n    strokeWeight(this.radius * 2);\n    stroke(0, 100);\n    line(this.start.x, this.start.y, this.end.x, this.end.y);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    stroke(0);\n    line(this.start.x, this.start.y, this.end.x, this.end.y);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n现在假设载具位于路径半径之外, 并正继续远离路径.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.22, 一辆正偏离路径的载具. PDF 第 286 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-22-adding-a-vehicle-moving-off-and-away-from-the-path-page-286.png]]\n\n第一步是假设速度保持不变, 预测载具未来的位置:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// 先复制速度向量.\nlet future = vel.copy();\n// 把大小设为 25, 向前预测 25 像素.\nfuture.setMag(25);\n// 与当前位置相加得到未来位置.\nfuture.add(this.position);\n#+end_src\n\n接下来计算预测点到路径的距离. 点到直线的最短距离是 *法线*, normal, 的长度. 法线从该点延伸到直线并与直线垂直.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.23, 从未来位置垂直到路径的法线. PDF 第 287 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-23-the-normal-is-a-vector-that-extends-from-the-future-position-to-the-path-page-287.png]]\n\n定义 \\(\\vec A\\) 为路径起点到未来位置的向量:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet a = p5.Vector.sub(future, path.start);\n#+end_src\n\n定义 \\(\\vec B\\) 为路径起点到终点的向量:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet b = p5.Vector.sub(path.end, path.start);\n#+end_src\n\n根据三角函数, 从路径起点到法足的距离为\n\\[\n\\lVert\\vec A\\rVert\\cos\\theta\n\\]\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.24, 起点到法足的距离为 |A| cos(theta). PDF 第 287 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-24-the-distance-from-the-start-of-the-path-to-the-normal-is-vec-a-times-cos-page-287.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// 取得起点到法足的距离.\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\n// 把向量 b 缩放到该距离.\nb.setMag(d);\n// 将缩放后的 b 与路径起点相加得到法足.\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n#+end_src\n\n夹角可以用 =p5.Vector.angleBetween()= 求得:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// theta 是 A 与 B 的夹角.\nlet theta = p5.Vector.angleBetween(a, b);\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\nb.setMag(d);\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n#+end_src\n\n还可以进一步简化. 若先把 \\(\\vec B\\) 归一化, 则\n\\[\n\\vec A\\cdot\\vec B=\\lVert\\vec A\\rVert\\cos\\theta\n\\]\n也就是说, 点积直接给出 \\(\\vec A\\) 在单位向量 \\(\\vec B\\) 上的标量投影. 这就是 *标量投影*, scalar projection.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet theta = p5.Vector.angleBetween(a, b);\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\nb.setMag(d);\n// 归一化 b, 并用点积设置 b 的长度.\nb.normalize();\nb.setMag(a.dot(b));\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.25, A 在 B 上的标量投影等于 |A| cos(theta). PDF 第 289 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-25-the-scalar-projection-of-vec-a-onto-vec-b-is-equal-to-vec-a-times-cos-th-page-289.png]]\n\n得到法足后, 计算它与预测未来位置之间的距离. 若距离大于路径半径, 载具就有偏离路径的危险, 需要转向; 若仍在半径内, 则继续原来的运动.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.26, 未来位置位于路径内, 上, 和路径外, 下, 的两种情况. PDF 第 289 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-26-a-vehicle-with-a-future-position-on-the-path-top-and-one-thats-outside-t-page-289.jpg]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\n// 若载具位于路径外, 则寻找目标.\nif (distance > path.radius) {\n  // 期望速度和转向力可复用示例 5.1 的 seek().\n  this.seek(target);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n但载具不应直接寻找法足, 否则会左右摇摆并落后于路径方向. Reynolds 的方法是在路径上选择一个位于法足前方的点作为目标. 将沿路径方向的向量 \\(\\vec B\\) 设为 25 像素, 再与法足相加即可.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.27, 目标位于法足沿路径方向前方 25 像素处. PDF 第 290 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-27-the-target-is-25-pixels-an-arbitrary-choice-ahead-of-the-normal-point-al-page-290.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\nif (distance > path.radius) {\n  // 把大小任意设为 25 像素.\n  b.setMag(25);\n  // 把 b 加到 normalPoint, 得到路径前方 25 像素的目标.\n  let target = p5.Vector.add(normalPoint, b);\n  // 寻找目标.\n  this.seek(target);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Path {\n  constructor() {\n    // 路径具有表示宽度的半径.\n    this.radius = 20;\n    // 路径只有起点和终点两个点.\n    this.start = createVector(0, height / 3);\n    this.end = createVector(width, (2 * height) / 3);\n  }\n\n  // 绘制路径.\n  show() {\n    strokeWeight(this.radius * 2);\n    stroke(0, 100);\n    line(this.start.x, this.start.y, this.end.x, this.end.y);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    stroke(0);\n    line(this.start.x, this.start.y, this.end.x, this.end.y);\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "// 先复制速度向量.\nlet future = vel.copy();\n// 把大小设为 25, 向前预测 25 像素.\nfuture.setMag(25);\n// 与当前位置相加得到未来位置.\nfuture.add(this.position);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let a = p5.Vector.sub(future, path.start);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let b = p5.Vector.sub(path.end, path.start);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "// 取得起点到法足的距离.\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\n// 把向量 b 缩放到该距离.\nb.setMag(d);\n// 将缩放后的 b 与路径起点相加得到法足.\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "// theta 是 A 与 B 的夹角.\nlet theta = p5.Vector.angleBetween(a, b);\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\nb.setMag(d);\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let theta = p5.Vector.angleBetween(a, b);\nlet d = a.mag() * cos(theta);\nb.setMag(d);\n// 归一化 b, 并用点积设置 b 的长度.\nb.normalize();\nb.setMag(a.dot(b));\nlet normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(path.start, b);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\n// 若载具位于路径外, 则寻找目标.\nif (distance > path.radius) {\n  // 期望速度和转向力可复用示例 5.1 的 seek().\n  this.seek(target);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\nif (distance > path.radius) {\n  // 把大小任意设为 25 像素.\n  b.setMag(25);\n  // 把 b 加到 normalPoint, 得到路径前方 25 像素的目标.\n  let target = p5.Vector.add(normalPoint, b);\n  // 寻找目标.\n  this.seek(target);\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.6" :title "简单路径跟随" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.6: 简单路径跟随\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-6-simple-path-following\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 291-293\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.6, 简单路径跟随. PDF 第 291 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-6-simple-path-following-page-291.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  follow(path) {\n    // 步骤 1: 预测载具未来位置.\n    let future = this.velocity.copy();\n    future.setMag(25);\n    future.add(this.position);\n    // 步骤 2: 求路径上的法足.\n    let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, path.start, path.end);\n    // 步骤 3: 沿路径向前观察并设置目标.\n    // 为优化, 可仅在偏离路径时计算目标.\n    let b = p5.Vector.sub(path.end, path.start);\n    b.setMag(25);\n    let target = p5.Vector.add(normalPoint, b);\n    // 步骤 4: 若偏离路径,\n    // 寻找该目标以返回路径.\n    let distance = p5.Vector.dist(normalPoint, future);\n    if (distance > path.radius) {\n      this.seek(target);\n    }\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 5.28, getNormalPoint() 的 position, a 和 b 参数. PDF 第 292 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/figure-5-28-the-elements-of-the-getnormalpoint-function-position-a-and-b-page-292.jpg]]\n\n为了让主算法更清晰, 把求法足的代码封装进 =getNormalPoint()=. 它接收一个笛卡尔点 =position= 和线段端点 =a=, =b=:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  getNormalPoint(position, a, b) {\n    // 从 a 指向 position 的向量\n    let vectorA = p5.Vector.sub(position, a);\n    // 从 a 指向 b 的向量\n    let vectorB = p5.Vector.sub(b, a);\n    // 使用点积计算标量投影.\n    vectorB.normalize();\n    vectorB.mult(vectorA.dot(vectorB));\n    // 求线段上的法足.\n    let normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(a, vectorB);\n    return normalPoint;\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n到这里, =Path= 用一条线段描述路径, =Vehicle.follow()= 预测未来位置, 找到法足和前方目标, 必要时通过 =seek()= 返回路径. 但真实路线往往不止一条直线.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  follow(path) {\n    // 步骤 1: 预测载具未来位置.\n    let future = this.velocity.copy();\n    future.setMag(25);\n    future.add(this.position);\n    // 步骤 2: 求路径上的法足.\n    let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, path.start, path.end);\n    // 步骤 3: 沿路径向前观察并设置目标.\n    // 为优化, 可仅在偏离路径时计算目标.\n    let b = p5.Vector.sub(path.end, path.start);\n    b.setMag(25);\n    let target = p5.Vector.add(normalPoint, b);\n    // 步骤 4: 若偏离路径,\n    // 寻找该目标以返回路径.\n    let distance = p5.Vector.dist(normalPoint, future);\n    if (distance > path.radius) {\n      this.seek(target);\n    }\n  }\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "  getNormalPoint(position, a, b) {\n    // 从 a 指向 position 的向量\n    let vectorA = p5.Vector.sub(position, a);\n    // 从 a 指向 b 的向量\n    let vectorB = p5.Vector.sub(b, a);\n    // 使用点积计算标量投影.\n    vectorB.normalize();\n    vectorB.mult(vectorA.dot(vectorB));\n    // 求线段上的法足.\n    let normalPoint = p5.Vector.add(a, vectorB);\n    return normalPoint;\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.7" :title "多线段路径对象" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.7: 多线段路径对象\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-7-multiple-segments\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 294-296\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.7, 由多条线段构成的路径. PDF 第 294 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-7-path-made-of-multiple-line-segments-page-294.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Path {\n  constructor() {\n    this.radius = 20;\n    // 路径现在是点, 即 p5.Vector, 的数组.\n    this.points = [];\n  }\n\n  // 此方法用于向路径添加点.\n  addPoint(x, y) {\n    let pathPoint = createVector(x, y);\n    this.points.push(pathPoint);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 用较粗灰线绘制路径半径.\n    stroke(200);\n    strokeWeight(this.radius * 2);\n    noFill();\n    beginShape();\n    for (let pathPoint of this.points) {\n      vertex(pathPoint.x, pathPoint.y);\n    }\n    endShape();\n    // 用细线绘制路径中心.\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    beginShape();\n    for (let pathPoint of this.points) {\n      vertex(pathPoint.x, pathPoint.y);\n    }\n    endShape();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n对 =points= 数组中每对相邻点循环, 计算每一段的法足:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfor (let i = 0; i < path.points.length - 1; i++) {\n  let a = path.points[i];\n  let b = path.points[i + 1];\n  // 计算每条线段的法足.\n  let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, a, b);\n#+end_src\n\n在本例中路径从左向右, 因而可检查 =normalPoint.x= 是否位于 =a.x= 和 =b.x= 之间. 如果不在有限线段上, 暂时把线段终点当作法足:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n   if (normalPoint.x < a.x || normalPoint.x > b.x) {\n     // 如果无法得到在线段内的法足,\n     // 使用线段终点作为法足.\n     normalPoint = b.copy();\n   }\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Path {\n  constructor() {\n    this.radius = 20;\n    // 路径现在是点, 即 p5.Vector, 的数组.\n    this.points = [];\n  }\n\n  // 此方法用于向路径添加点.\n  addPoint(x, y) {\n    let pathPoint = createVector(x, y);\n    this.points.push(pathPoint);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    // 用较粗灰线绘制路径半径.\n    stroke(200);\n    strokeWeight(this.radius * 2);\n    noFill();\n    beginShape();\n    for (let pathPoint of this.points) {\n      vertex(pathPoint.x, pathPoint.y);\n    }\n    endShape();\n    // 用细线绘制路径中心.\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    beginShape();\n    for (let pathPoint of this.points) {\n      vertex(pathPoint.x, pathPoint.y);\n    }\n    endShape();\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "for (let i = 0; i < path.points.length - 1; i++) {\n  let a = path.points[i];\n  let b = path.points[i + 1];\n  // 计算每条线段的法足.\n  let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, a, b);\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "   if (normalPoint.x < a.x || normalPoint.x > b.x) {\n     // 如果无法得到在线段内的法足,\n     // 使用线段终点作为法足.\n     normalPoint = b.copy();\n   }\n"]]} {:id "5.8" :title "路径跟随" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.8: 路径跟随\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-8-path-following\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 296-298\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.8, 跟随多线段路径. PDF 第 296 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-8-path-following-page-296.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet target = null;\n// 从易于被打破的极大纪录开始, 例如 Infinity.\nlet worldRecord = Infinity;\nfor (let i = 0; i < path.points.length - 1; i++) {\n  let a = path.points[i];\n  let b = path.points[i + 1];\n  let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, a, b);\n  if (normalPoint.x < a.x || normalPoint.x > b.x) {\n    normalPoint = b.copy();\n  }\n\n  let distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\n  // 若刷新纪录, 该点成为目标.\n  if (distance < worldRecord) {\n    worldRecord = distance;\n    target = normalPoint.copy();\n  }\n  // 沿线段方向在法足前方寻找目标.\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(b, a);\n  dir.setMag(25);\n  target.add(dir);\n}\n#+end_src\n\nJavaScript 的 =Infinity= 是特殊数值, 可以确保第一个真实距离必然刷新纪录. 代码中硬编码的 25 表示目标位于法足前方的距离. Reynolds 建议让它随载具速度和偏离路径的程度动态变化, 这样可以提高响应性和跟随精度.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let target = null;\n// 从易于被打破的极大纪录开始, 例如 Infinity.\nlet worldRecord = Infinity;\nfor (let i = 0; i < path.points.length - 1; i++) {\n  let a = path.points[i];\n  let b = path.points[i + 1];\n  let normalPoint = getNormalPoint(future, a, b);\n  if (normalPoint.x < a.x || normalPoint.x > b.x) {\n    normalPoint = b.copy();\n  }\n\n  let distance = p5.Vector.dist(future, normalPoint);\n  // 若刷新纪录, 该点成为目标.\n  if (distance < worldRecord) {\n    worldRecord = distance;\n    target = normalPoint.copy();\n  }\n  // 沿线段方向在法足前方寻找目标.\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(b, a);\n  dir.setMag(25);\n  target.add(dir);\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.9" :title "分离" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.9: 分离\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-9-separation\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 304-305\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.9, 分离行为. PDF 第 304 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-9-separation-page-304.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  separate(vehicles) {\n    // 期望分离距离基于\n    // 载具尺寸.\n    let desiredSeparation = this.r * 2;\n    let sum = createVector(0, 0);\n    let count = 0;\n    for (let other of vehicles) {\n      let d = p5.Vector.dist(this.position, other.position);\n      if (this !== other && d < desiredSeparation) {\n        let diff = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, other.position);\n        // 远离邻居的 p5.Vector\n        // 应具有多大大小?\n        // 越近越应强烈逃离.\n        // 越远影响越小, 因此大小设为\n        // 与距离成反比.\n        diff.setMag(1 / d);\n        sum.add(diff);\n        count++;\n      }\n    }\n    if (count > 0) {\n      sum.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n      let steer = p5.Vector.sub(sum, this.velocity);\n      steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n      this.applyForce(steer);\n    }\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n这个版本包含两项改进. 第一, 期望分离距离与载具尺寸相关, 不再是固定常量. 第二, 逃离向量的大小设为距离的倒数. 邻居越近, 逃离愿望越强; 越远, 影响越弱.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  separate(vehicles) {\n    // 期望分离距离基于\n    // 载具尺寸.\n    let desiredSeparation = this.r * 2;\n    let sum = createVector(0, 0);\n    let count = 0;\n    for (let other of vehicles) {\n      let d = p5.Vector.dist(this.position, other.position);\n      if (this !== other && d < desiredSeparation) {\n        let diff = p5.Vector.sub(this.position, other.position);\n        // 远离邻居的 p5.Vector\n        // 应具有多大大小?\n        // 越近越应强烈逃离.\n        // 越远影响越小, 因此大小设为\n        // 与距离成反比.\n        diff.setMag(1 / d);\n        sum.add(diff);\n        count++;\n      }\n    }\n    if (count > 0) {\n      sum.setMag(this.maxspeed);\n      let steer = p5.Vector.sub(sum, this.velocity);\n      steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n      this.applyForce(steer);\n    }\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.10" :title "组合寻找与分离" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.10: 组合寻找与分离\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-10-combining-steering\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 307-308\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.10, 组合寻找和分离行为. PDF 第 307 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-10-combining-steering-behaviors-seek-and-separate-page-307.jpg]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\napplyBehaviors(vehicles) {\n  let separate = this.separate(vehicles);\n  let seek = this.seek(createVector(mouseX, mouseY));\n  // 这些权重可以按需要设定.\n  // 它们可以按每个载具定制,\n  // 也可以随时间变化.\n  separate.mult(1.5);\n  seek.mult(0.5);\n  this.applyForce(separate);\n  this.applyForce(seek);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=mult()= 缩放各个力的大小, 1.5 和 0.5 就是行为权重. 权重可以随环境和个体属性变化. 例如食物靠近或 =hunger= 增大时提高寻找权重, 进入拥挤区域时提高分离权重. 这种动态权重能够形成更细腻的行为层次.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "applyBehaviors(vehicles) {\n  let separate = this.separate(vehicles);\n  let seek = this.seek(createVector(mouseX, mouseY));\n  // 这些权重可以按需要设定.\n  // 它们可以按每个载具定制,\n  // 也可以随时间变化.\n  separate.mult(1.5);\n  seek.mult(0.5);\n  this.applyForce(separate);\n  this.applyForce(seek);\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.11" :title "鸟群" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.11: 鸟群\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-11-flocking\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 313-315\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.11, 鸟群行为. PDF 第 313 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-11-flocking-page-313.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n// Flock 对象管理\n// 整个群体.\nlet flock;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  flock = new Flock();\n  for (let i = 0; i < 120; i++) {\n    let boid = new Boid(width / 2, height / 2);\n    // 鸟群初始包含 120 个 boid.\n    flock.addBoid(boid);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  flock.run();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n与粒子系统一样, OOP 让 =setup()= 和 =draw()= 保持非常简洁, 复杂行为被封装在 =Flock= 与 =Boid= 内部.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "// Flock 对象管理\n// 整个群体.\nlet flock;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  flock = new Flock();\n  for (let i = 0; i < 120; i++) {\n    let boid = new Boid(width / 2, height / 2);\n    // 鸟群初始包含 120 个 boid.\n    flock.addBoid(boid);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  flock.run();\n}\n"]]} {:id "5.12" :title "箱格空间细分" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.12: 箱格空间细分\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-12-bin-lattice\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 318-319\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.12, 使用箱格空间细分优化鸟群. PDF 第 318 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-12-bin-lattice-spatial-subdivision-page-318.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n  run(boids) {\n    let column = floor(this.position.x / resolution);\n    let row = floor(this.position.y / resolution);\n    column = constrain(column, 0, cols - 1);\n    row = constrain(row, 0, rows - 1);\n    // 只检查这些 boid. 邻接单元的处理参见完整代码.\n    let neighbors = grid[column][row]; \n    this.flock(neighbors);\n    this.update();\n    this.borders();\n    this.render();\n  }\n#+end_src\n\n完整实现还应检查上, 下, 左, 右和四个对角相邻单元. 即便如此, 仍远少于检查所有 boid.\n\n固定网格在元素均匀分布时最有效. 如果所有 boid 聚集到一个角落并落在同一格, 最坏情况又会退化为全体互查. *四叉树*, quadtree, 能根据元素分布动态细分空间. 它从覆盖全部区域的一个大单元开始, 当某个单元容纳过多对象时分裂为四个子单元, 子单元过密时继续递归分裂, 因而只在需要的位置提供更高分辨率.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "  run(boids) {\n    let column = floor(this.position.x / resolution);\n    let row = floor(this.position.y / resolution);\n    column = constrain(column, 0, cols - 1);\n    row = constrain(row, 0, rows - 1);\n    // 只检查这些 boid. 邻接单元的处理参见完整代码.\n    let neighbors = grid[column][row]; \n    this.flock(neighbors);\n    this.update();\n    this.borders();\n    this.render();\n  }\n"]]} {:id "5.13" :title "四叉树" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.13: 四叉树\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-13-quadtree\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 319-320\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.13, 四叉树空间划分. PDF 第 319 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-13-quadtree-page-319.png]]\n\n四叉树也是 Barnes-Hut 算法的关键数据结构. 在 n 体模拟中, 它可以把远处的一组天体近似为一个整体来计算引力, 大幅减少所需计算次数.\n\n" :code []} {:id "5.14" :title "Sin/Cos 查找表" :chapter 5 :org "*** 示例 5.14: Sin/Cos 查找表\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-5-14-sincos-lookup\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 322-323\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 5.14, 正弦和余弦查找表. PDF 第 322 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/example-5-14-sin-cos-lookup-table-page-322.png]]\n\n**** 不要创建无数不必要的 p5.Vector\n\n每个对象都占用内存. 少量临时对象通常没有问题, 但在循环和长期动画中不断创建大量对象, 会增加分配和垃圾回收成本. 例如:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n若有 1,000 个载具, 每帧会为同一个鼠标位置创建 1,000 个向量. 把向量移到循环外, 每帧只创建一次:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n还可以在 =setup()= 前创建全局向量, 每帧只用 =set()= 更新其分量, 从而启动后不再创建新对象:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet mouse;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  mouse = createVector(0, 0);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  mouse.set(mouseX, mouseY);\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n同样, =seek()= 原本创建 =desired= 和 =steer= 两个向量:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.normalize();\n    desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n    // 创建新向量保存转向力.\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired,this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    return steer;\n#+end_src\n\n可以直接复用 =desired=, 在其中减去当前速度并把它转化为转向力:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\n    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.normalize();\n    desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n    // 直接在 desired 向量中计算转向力.\n    desired.sub(this.velocity);\n    desired.limit(this.maxforce);\n    return desired;\n#+end_src\n\n后一种写法更省对象, 但语义稍不直观. 优化应针对实际瓶颈, 不必为了微小收益牺牲所有可读性.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  let mouse = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "let mouse;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  mouse = createVector(0, 0);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  mouse.set(mouseX, mouseY);\n  for (let v of vehicles) {\n    v.seek(mouse);\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.normalize();\n    desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n    // 创建新向量保存转向力.\n    let steer = p5.Vector.sub(desired,this.velocity);\n    steer.limit(this.maxforce);\n    return steer;\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "    let desired = p5.Vector.sub(target, this.position);\n    desired.normalize();\n    desired.mult(this.maxspeed);\n    // 直接在 desired 向量中计算转向力.\n    desired.sub(this.velocity);\n    desired.limit(this.maxforce);\n    return desired;\n"]]} {:id "6.1" :title "Matter.js 默认 Render 与 Runner" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.1: Matter.js 默认 Render 与 Runner\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-1-default-render-runner\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 341-342\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.1, Matter.js 默认调试渲染器与运行器. PDF 第 341 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-341-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nconst { Engine, Bodies, Composite, Body, Vector, Render } = Matter;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  let canvas = createCanvas(640, 360);\n  let engine = Engine.create();\n\n  let render = Render.create({\n    canvas: canvas.elt,\n    engine,\n    options: { width: width, height: height }\n  });\n  Render.run(render);\n\n  let options = { friction: 0.01, restitution: 0.75 };\n  let box = Bodies.rectangle(100, 100, 50, 50, options);\n  Body.setVelocity(box, Vector.create(5, 0));\n  Body.setAngularVelocity(box, 0.1);\n  Composite.add(engine.world, box);\n\n  let ground = Bodies.rectangle(\n    width / 2,\n    height - 5,\n    width,\n    10,\n    { isStatic: true }\n  );\n  Composite.add(engine.world, ground);\n\n  let runner = Matter.Runner.create();\n  Matter.Runner.run(runner, engine);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n在这个例子中, p5.js 的 =draw()= 没有参与渲染. Matter.js 的 Render 与 Runner 完成更新和绘制. 下一节会把视觉控制权交还给 p5.js.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "const { Engine, Bodies, Composite, Body, Vector, Render } = Matter;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  let canvas = createCanvas(640, 360);\n  let engine = Engine.create();\n\n  let render = Render.create({\n    canvas: canvas.elt,\n    engine,\n    options: { width: width, height: height }\n  });\n  Render.run(render);\n\n  let options = { friction: 0.01, restitution: 0.75 };\n  let box = Bodies.rectangle(100, 100, 50, 50, options);\n  Body.setVelocity(box, Vector.create(5, 0));\n  Body.setAngularVelocity(box, 0.1);\n  Composite.add(engine.world, box);\n\n  let ground = Bodies.rectangle(\n    width / 2,\n    height - 5,\n    width,\n    10,\n    { isStatic: true }\n  );\n  Composite.add(engine.world, ground);\n\n  let runner = Matter.Runner.create();\n  Matter.Runner.run(runner, engine);\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.2" :title "一个舒服的 p5.js 草图, 加上一点 Matter.js" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.2: 一个舒服的 p5.js 草图, 加上一点 Matter.js\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-2-p5js-matterjs\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 343-347\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.2, p5.js 绘制由 Matter.js 驱动的方块. PDF 第 343 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-343-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nconst { Engine, Bodies, Composite } = Matter;\n\nlet engine;\nlet boxes = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  engine = Engine.create();\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  boxes.push(new Box(mouseX, mouseY));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  Engine.update(engine);\n\n  for (let i = boxes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    boxes[i].show();\n    if (boxes[i].isOffScreen()) {\n      boxes[i].removeBody();\n      boxes.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Box {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.w = 16;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, this.w, this.w);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(2);\n    square(0, 0, this.w);\n    pop();\n  }\n\n  isOffScreen() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    return pos.y > height + 100;\n  }\n\n  removeBody() {\n    Composite.remove(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n当删除应用层数组元素时, 还必须从 Matter.js 世界中移除对应 Body. 否则不可见的物体仍会参与碰撞计算并持续消耗资源.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "const { Engine, Bodies, Composite } = Matter;\n\nlet engine;\nlet boxes = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  engine = Engine.create();\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  boxes.push(new Box(mouseX, mouseY));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  Engine.update(engine);\n\n  for (let i = boxes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    boxes[i].show();\n    if (boxes[i].isOffScreen()) {\n      boxes[i].removeBody();\n      boxes.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Box {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.w = 16;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, this.w, this.w);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(2);\n    square(0, 0, this.w);\n    pop();\n  }\n\n  isOffScreen() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    return pos.y > height + 100;\n  }\n\n  removeBody() {\n    Composite.remove(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.3" :title "下落方块撞击边界" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.3: 下落方块撞击边界\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-3-falling-boxes\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 348-349\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.3, 下落方块撞击静态边界. PDF 第 348 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-348-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Boundary {\n  constructor(x, y, w, h, angle = 0) {\n    this.w = w;\n    this.h = h;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, w, h, {\n      isStatic: true,\n      angle\n    });\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    rect(0, 0, this.w, this.h);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n静态物体也可以拥有旋转角, 因而能构造斜坡, 漏斗和复杂地形.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Boundary {\n  constructor(x, y, w, h, angle = 0) {\n    this.w = w;\n    this.h = h;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, w, h, {\n      isStatic: true,\n      angle\n    });\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    rect(0, 0, this.w, this.h);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.4" :title "多边形形状" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.4: 多边形形状\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-4-polygon-shapes\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 349-352\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.4, 不同边数的 Matter.js 多边形. PDF 第 349 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-349-image-02.png]]\n\n绘制任意 Body 时, 可以读取 =body.vertices= 并用 =beginShape()= 与 =vertex()= 逐点绘制:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nshow() {\n  let vertices = this.body.vertices;\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  beginShape();\n  for (let v of vertices) {\n    vertex(v.x, v.y);\n  }\n  endShape(CLOSE);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 6.5, Body 的 vertices 数组保存世界坐标中的顶点. PDF 第 350 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-350-image-01.png]]\n\nMatter.js 会把凹多边形分解为多个凸部分. 若顶点来自 SVG 路径, 可以先将路径转换为点集, 再用 =Bodies.fromVertices()= 创建 Body.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 6.6, 将凹多边形分解为凸多边形. PDF 第 351 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 650\n[[file:images/pdf-page-351-image-01.jpg]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "show() {\n  let vertices = this.body.vertices;\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  beginShape();\n  for (let v of vertices) {\n    vertex(v.x, v.y);\n  }\n  endShape(CLOSE);\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.5" :title "一个 Body 上的多个形状" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.5: 一个 Body 上的多个形状\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-5-multiple-shapes-one-body\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 353-355\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.5, 由多个形状组成的单一刚体. PDF 第 353 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-353-image-02.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Lollipop {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    let circlePart = Bodies.circle(x, y - 20, 16);\n    let stemPart = Bodies.rectangle(x, y + 10, 8, 60);\n    this.body = Body.create({\n      parts: [circlePart, stemPart],\n      restitution: 0.6\n    });\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    rect(0, 10, 8, 60);\n    circle(0, -20, 32);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 6.9, 当绘制外形与 Matter.js 物理几何不一致时, 碰撞位置会发生错位. PDF 第 355 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 620\n[[file:images/pdf-page-355-image-01.png]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Lollipop {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    let circlePart = Bodies.circle(x, y - 20, 16);\n    let stemPart = Bodies.rectangle(x, y + 10, 8, 60);\n    this.body = Body.create({\n      parts: [circlePart, stemPart],\n      restitution: 0.6\n    });\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    let angle = this.body.angle;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(angle);\n    stroke(0);\n    fill(127);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    rect(0, 10, 8, 60);\n    circle(0, -20, 32);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.6" :title "Matter.js 摆" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.6: Matter.js 摆\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-6-matterjs-pendulum\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 357-359\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.6, 使用距离约束构造摆. PDF 第 357 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-357-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Pendulum {\n  constructor(x, y, len) {\n    this.r = 12;\n    this.len = len;\n\n    this.anchor = Bodies.circle(x, y, this.r, {\n      isStatic: true\n    });\n    this.bob = Bodies.circle(x + len, y, this.r, {\n      restitution: 0.6\n    });\n\n    this.arm = Constraint.create({\n      bodyA: this.anchor,\n      bodyB: this.bob,\n      length: this.len\n    });\n\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.anchor);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.bob);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.arm);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    line(\n      this.anchor.position.x,\n      this.anchor.position.y,\n      this.bob.position.x,\n      this.bob.position.y\n    );\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.anchor.position.x, this.anchor.position.y);\n    rotate(this.anchor.angle);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    line(0, 0, this.r, 0);\n    pop();\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.bob.position.x, this.bob.position.y);\n    rotate(this.bob.angle);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    line(0, 0, this.r, 0);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n默认刚度约为 =0.7=. 降低刚度后, 摆臂会表现得更像柔软弹簧. 约束本身没有必须显示的几何形状, 绘制的线只是视觉解释. 可以隐藏它, 画成点链, 绳索或其他图形.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Pendulum {\n  constructor(x, y, len) {\n    this.r = 12;\n    this.len = len;\n\n    this.anchor = Bodies.circle(x, y, this.r, {\n      isStatic: true\n    });\n    this.bob = Bodies.circle(x + len, y, this.r, {\n      restitution: 0.6\n    });\n\n    this.arm = Constraint.create({\n      bodyA: this.anchor,\n      bodyB: this.bob,\n      length: this.len\n    });\n\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.anchor);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.bob);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.arm);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    line(\n      this.anchor.position.x,\n      this.anchor.position.y,\n      this.bob.position.x,\n      this.bob.position.y\n    );\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.anchor.position.x, this.anchor.position.y);\n    rotate(this.anchor.angle);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    line(0, 0, this.r, 0);\n    pop();\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.bob.position.x, this.bob.position.y);\n    rotate(this.bob.angle);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    line(0, 0, this.r, 0);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.7" :title "旋转风车" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.7: 旋转风车\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-7-spinning-windmill\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 360-362\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.7, 通过零长度约束构造旋转风车. PDF 第 360 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-360-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Windmill {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.w = 120;\n    this.h = 10;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, this.w, this.h);\n    this.joint = Constraint.create({\n      bodyA: this.body,\n      pointB: Vector.create(x, y),\n      length: 0,\n      stiffness: 1\n    });\n\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.joint);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(this.body.angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    rect(0, 0, this.w, this.h);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Windmill {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.w = 120;\n    this.h = 10;\n    this.body = Bodies.rectangle(x, y, this.w, this.h);\n    this.joint = Constraint.create({\n      bodyA: this.body,\n      pointB: Vector.create(x, y),\n      length: 0,\n      stiffness: 1\n    });\n\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.body);\n    Composite.add(engine.world, this.joint);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let pos = this.body.position;\n    push();\n    translate(pos.x, pos.y);\n    rotate(this.body.angle);\n    rectMode(CENTER);\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    rect(0, 0, this.w, this.h);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.8" :title "MouseConstraint 演示" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.8: MouseConstraint 演示\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-8-mouse-constraint\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 364-364\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.8, 使用鼠标约束拖动物体. PDF 第 364 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-364-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet mouseConstraint;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  let canvas = createCanvas(640, 240);\n  engine = Engine.create();\n\n  let mouse = Mouse.create(canvas.elt);\n  mouseConstraint = MouseConstraint.create(engine, {\n    mouse,\n    constraint: { stiffness: 0.2 }\n  });\n  Composite.add(engine.world, mouseConstraint);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  Engine.update(engine);\n\n  // 可选, 绘制抓取时的连接线.\n  if (mouseConstraint.body) {\n    let pos = mouseConstraint.body.position;\n    let m = mouseConstraint.mouse.position;\n    line(pos.x, pos.y, m.x, m.y);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let mouseConstraint;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  let canvas = createCanvas(640, 240);\n  engine = Engine.create();\n\n  let mouse = Mouse.create(canvas.elt);\n  mouseConstraint = MouseConstraint.create(engine, {\n    mouse,\n    constraint: { stiffness: 0.2 }\n  });\n  Composite.add(engine.world, mouseConstraint);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  Engine.update(engine);\n\n  // 可选, 绘制抓取时的连接线.\n  if (mouseConstraint.body) {\n    let pos = mouseConstraint.body.position;\n    let m = mouseConstraint.mouse.position;\n    line(pos.x, pos.y, m.x, m.y);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.9" :title "使用 Matter.js 实现吸引" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.9: 使用 Matter.js 实现吸引\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-9-attraction-matterjs\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 365-367\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.9, Matter.js 中的引力吸引. PDF 第 365 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-365-image-01.png]]\n\n万有引力公式仍然是:\n\n\\[\n  F_g = \\frac{G m_1 m_2}{d^2}\n\\]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction attract(bodyA, bodyB) {\n  let force = Vector.sub(bodyA.position, bodyB.position);\n  let distance = Vector.magnitude(force);\n  distance = constrain(distance, 5, 25);\n\n  let strength =\n    (G * bodyA.mass * bodyB.mass) /\n    (distance * distance);\n\n  force = Vector.normalise(force);\n  force = Vector.mult(force, strength);\n  Body.applyForce(bodyB, bodyB.position, force);\n}\n#+end_src\n\nMatter.js 的 Body 质量由密度与几何形状共同决定. 这意味着同样大小但密度不同的对象会产生不同的引力响应.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function attract(bodyA, bodyB) {\n  let force = Vector.sub(bodyA.position, bodyB.position);\n  let distance = Vector.magnitude(force);\n  distance = constrain(distance, 5, 25);\n\n  let strength =\n    (G * bodyA.mass * bodyB.mass) /\n    (distance * distance);\n\n  force = Vector.normalise(force);\n  force = Vector.mult(force, strength);\n  Body.applyForce(bodyB, bodyB.position, force);\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.10" :title "碰撞事件" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.10: 碰撞事件\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-10-collision-events\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 370-371\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.10, 碰撞发生时改变粒子状态. PDF 第 370 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-370-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction handleCollisions(event) {\n  for (let pair of event.pairs) {\n    let bodyA = pair.bodyA;\n    let bodyB = pair.bodyB;\n\n    let particleA = bodyA.plugin.particle;\n    let particleB = bodyB.plugin.particle;\n\n    if (\n      particleA instanceof Particle &&\n      particleB instanceof Particle\n    ) {\n      particleA.change();\n      particleB.change();\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n不能假定每个碰撞对象都是 Particle. 它也可能是 Boundary 或其他类型. 使用 =instanceof= 或自定义标签检查类型后再执行行为.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function handleCollisions(event) {\n  for (let pair of event.pairs) {\n    let bodyA = pair.bodyA;\n    let bodyB = pair.bodyB;\n\n    let particleA = bodyA.plugin.particle;\n    let particleB = bodyB.plugin.particle;\n\n    if (\n      particleA instanceof Particle &&\n      particleB instanceof Particle\n    ) {\n      particleA.change();\n      particleB.change();\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.11" :title "Toxiclibs.js 简单弹簧" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.11: Toxiclibs.js 简单弹簧\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-11-simple-spring-toxiclibs\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 380-382\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.11, 两个粒子通过 Toxiclibs.js 弹簧连接. PDF 第 380 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-380-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet { Vec2D, Rect } = toxi.geom;\nlet {\n  VerletPhysics2D,\n  VerletParticle2D,\n  VerletSpring2D\n} = toxi.physics2d;\nlet { GravityBehavior } = toxi.physics2d.behaviors;\n\nlet physics;\nlet particle1;\nlet particle2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  physics.setWorldBounds(new Rect(0, 0, width, height));\n  physics.addBehavior(\n    new GravityBehavior(new Vec2D(0, 0.5))\n  );\n\n  let length = 120;\n  particle1 = new Particle(width / 2, 0, 8);\n  particle2 = new Particle(width / 2 + length, 0, 8);\n  particle1.lock();\n\n  let spring = new VerletSpring2D(\n    particle1,\n    particle2,\n    length,\n    0.01\n  );\n\n  physics.addParticle(particle1);\n  physics.addParticle(particle2);\n  physics.addSpring(spring);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  line(particle1.x, particle1.y, particle2.x, particle2.y);\n  particle1.show();\n  particle2.show();\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    particle2.lock();\n    particle2.x = mouseX;\n    particle2.y = mouseY;\n    particle2.unlock();\n  }\n}\n\nclass Particle extends VerletParticle2D {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    super(x, y);\n    this.r = r;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    circle(this.x, this.y, this.r * 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n物理弹簧是否可见与其是否存在无关. 可以用线显示, 也可以隐藏连接, 只把粒子位置用于控制更复杂的图形.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let { Vec2D, Rect } = toxi.geom;\nlet {\n  VerletPhysics2D,\n  VerletParticle2D,\n  VerletSpring2D\n} = toxi.physics2d;\nlet { GravityBehavior } = toxi.physics2d.behaviors;\n\nlet physics;\nlet particle1;\nlet particle2;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  physics.setWorldBounds(new Rect(0, 0, width, height));\n  physics.addBehavior(\n    new GravityBehavior(new Vec2D(0, 0.5))\n  );\n\n  let length = 120;\n  particle1 = new Particle(width / 2, 0, 8);\n  particle2 = new Particle(width / 2 + length, 0, 8);\n  particle1.lock();\n\n  let spring = new VerletSpring2D(\n    particle1,\n    particle2,\n    length,\n    0.01\n  );\n\n  physics.addParticle(particle1);\n  physics.addParticle(particle2);\n  physics.addSpring(spring);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  line(particle1.x, particle1.y, particle2.x, particle2.y);\n  particle1.show();\n  particle2.show();\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    particle2.lock();\n    particle2.x = mouseX;\n    particle2.y = mouseY;\n    particle2.unlock();\n  }\n}\n\nclass Particle extends VerletParticle2D {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    super(x, y);\n    this.r = r;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(127);\n    stroke(0);\n    circle(this.x, this.y, this.r * 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.12" :title "柔软摆" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.12: 柔软摆\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-12-soft-swinging-pendulum\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 385-386\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.12, 由粒子链构成的柔软摆. PDF 第 385 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-385-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  beginShape();\n  for (let particle of particles) {\n    vertex(particle.x, particle.y);\n  }\n  endShape();\n\n  particles[particles.length - 1].show();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n最后一个粒子作为摆锤绘制为圆, 中间粒子只作为折线顶点. 这说明视觉层不必显示每个物理元素.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  beginShape();\n  for (let particle of particles) {\n    vertex(particle.x, particle.y);\n  }\n  endShape();\n\n  particles[particles.length - 1].show();\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.13" :title "软体角色" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.13: 软体角色\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-13-soft-body-character\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 389-390\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.13, 带内部支撑的软体角色. PDF 第 389 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-389-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet physics;\nlet particles = [];\nlet springs = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  physics.setWorldBounds(new Rect(0, 0, width, height));\n  physics.addBehavior(\n    new GravityBehavior(new Vec2D(0, 0.5))\n  );\n\n  particles.push(new Particle(200, 25));\n  particles.push(new Particle(400, 25));\n  particles.push(new Particle(350, 125));\n  particles.push(new Particle(400, 225));\n  particles.push(new Particle(200, 225));\n  particles.push(new Particle(250, 125));\n\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[0], particles[1]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[1], particles[2]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[2], particles[3]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[3], particles[4]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[4], particles[5]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[5], particles[0]));\n\n  // 内部支撑.\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[5], particles[2]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[0], particles[3]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[1], particles[4]));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  physics.update();\n\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  beginShape();\n  for (let particle of particles) {\n    vertex(particle.x, particle.y);\n  }\n  endShape(CLOSE);\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    particles[0].lock();\n    particles[0].x = mouseX;\n    particles[0].y = mouseY;\n    particles[0].unlock();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个示例没有绘制粒子圆点和内部弹簧. 它只读取外轮廓粒子的位置并绘制一个整体形状. 物理骨架与视觉设计可以分离, 因此眼睛, 天线, 纹理等元素不必全部参与物理计算.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let physics;\nlet particles = [];\nlet springs = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  physics.setWorldBounds(new Rect(0, 0, width, height));\n  physics.addBehavior(\n    new GravityBehavior(new Vec2D(0, 0.5))\n  );\n\n  particles.push(new Particle(200, 25));\n  particles.push(new Particle(400, 25));\n  particles.push(new Particle(350, 125));\n  particles.push(new Particle(400, 225));\n  particles.push(new Particle(200, 225));\n  particles.push(new Particle(250, 125));\n\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[0], particles[1]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[1], particles[2]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[2], particles[3]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[3], particles[4]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[4], particles[5]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[5], particles[0]));\n\n  // 内部支撑.\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[5], particles[2]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[0], particles[3]));\n  springs.push(new Spring(particles[1], particles[4]));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  physics.update();\n\n  fill(127);\n  stroke(0);\n  beginShape();\n  for (let particle of particles) {\n    vertex(particle.x, particle.y);\n  }\n  endShape(CLOSE);\n\n  if (mouseIsPressed) {\n    particles[0].lock();\n    particles[0].x = mouseX;\n    particles[0].y = mouseY;\n    particles[0].unlock();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.14" :title "Cluster" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.14: Cluster\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-14-cluster\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 393-394\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.14, 完全连接的粒子簇. PDF 第 393 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-393-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet { VerletPhysics2D, VerletParticle2D, VerletSpring2D } =\n  toxi.physics2d;\n\nlet physics;\nlet cluster;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  cluster = new Cluster(\n    floor(random(2, 20)),\n    random(10, height / 2)\n  );\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n  cluster.show();\n}\n#+end_src\n\n示例中的节点数, 平衡长度和弹簧强度是随机或固定参数. 在真实数据可视化中, 它们可映射到实体数量, 相似度, 关系强度或网络权重.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let { VerletPhysics2D, VerletParticle2D, VerletSpring2D } =\n  toxi.physics2d;\n\nlet physics;\nlet cluster;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  physics = new VerletPhysics2D();\n  cluster = new Cluster(\n    floor(random(2, 20)),\n    random(10, height / 2)\n  );\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  physics.update();\n  background(255);\n  cluster.show();\n}\n"]]} {:id "6.15" :title "吸引与排斥 Behavior" :chapter 6 :org "*** 示例 6.15: 吸引与排斥 Behavior\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-6-15-attraction-repulsion\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 397-397\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 6.15, 同一 Attractor 同时产生远距离吸引和近距离排斥. PDF 第 397 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-397-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Attractor extends VerletParticle2D {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    super(x, y);\n    this.r = r;\n\n    // 在较大范围内吸引.\n    physics.addBehavior(\n      new AttractionBehavior(this, width, 0.1)\n    );\n\n    // 在自身半径内强烈排斥.\n    physics.addBehavior(\n      new AttractionBehavior(this, this.r, -10)\n    );\n\n    physics.addParticle(this);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(0);\n    circle(this.x, this.y, this.r * 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n当每个粒子都与每个粒子交互时, 复杂度接近 \\(N^2\\). 粒子数量增大后, 可以改用空间分箱, 四叉树或其他邻域查询算法, 只对附近粒子计算自定义力. 这时需要放弃全局 AttractionBehavior, 改为手动调用 =addForce()=.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Attractor extends VerletParticle2D {\n  constructor(x, y, r) {\n    super(x, y);\n    this.r = r;\n\n    // 在较大范围内吸引.\n    physics.addBehavior(\n      new AttractionBehavior(this, width, 0.1)\n    );\n\n    // 在自身半径内强烈排斥.\n    physics.addBehavior(\n      new AttractionBehavior(this, this.r, -10)\n    );\n\n    physics.addParticle(this);\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    fill(0);\n    circle(this.x, this.y, this.r * 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "7.1" :title "Wolfram 初等元胞自动机" :chapter 7 :org "*** 示例 7.1: Wolfram 初等元胞自动机\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-7-1-wolfram-elementary-ca\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 417-418\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 7.1, 规则 90 在 p5.js 中生成的图案. PDF 第 417 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-417-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet cells;\nlet generation = 0;\nlet w = 10;\nlet ruleset = [0, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  background(255);\n\n  cells = new Array(floor(width / w));\n  for (let i = 0; i < cells.length; i++) {\n    cells[i] = 0;\n  }\n  cells[floor(cells.length / 2)] = 1;\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  for (let i = 1; i < cells.length - 1; i++) {\n    if (cells[i] === 1) {\n      fill(0);\n      square(i * w, generation * w, w);\n    }\n  }\n\n  let nextgen = cells.slice();\n  for (let i = 1; i < cells.length - 1; i++) {\n    let left = cells[i - 1];\n    let me = cells[i];\n    let right = cells[i + 1];\n    nextgen[i] = rules(left, me, right);\n  }\n\n  cells = nextgen;\n  generation++;\n}\n\nfunction rules(a, b, c) {\n  let s = \"\" + a + b + c;\n  let index = parseInt(s, 2);\n  return ruleset[7 - index];\n}\n#+end_src\n\n示例只绘制状态 1 的黑色方块, 白色背景天然代表状态 0. 这减少了绘图次数. 但代码仍会在图案越过画布底部后继续计算, 实际项目应停止, 重置或滚动历史.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let cells;\nlet generation = 0;\nlet w = 10;\nlet ruleset = [0, 1, 0, 1, 1, 0, 1, 0];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  background(255);\n\n  cells = new Array(floor(width / w));\n  for (let i = 0; i < cells.length; i++) {\n    cells[i] = 0;\n  }\n  cells[floor(cells.length / 2)] = 1;\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  for (let i = 1; i < cells.length - 1; i++) {\n    if (cells[i] === 1) {\n      fill(0);\n      square(i * w, generation * w, w);\n    }\n  }\n\n  let nextgen = cells.slice();\n  for (let i = 1; i < cells.length - 1; i++) {\n    let left = cells[i - 1];\n    let me = cells[i];\n    let right = cells[i + 1];\n    nextgen[i] = rules(left, me, right);\n  }\n\n  cells = nextgen;\n  generation++;\n}\n\nfunction rules(a, b, c) {\n  let s = \"\" + a + b + c;\n  let index = parseInt(s, 2);\n  return ruleset[7 - index];\n}\n"]]} {:id "7.2" :title "生命游戏" :chapter 7 :org "*** 示例 7.2: 生命游戏\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-7-2-game-of-life\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 429-430\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 7.2, 随机初始化的生命游戏. PDF 第 429 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-429-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet board;\nlet columns;\nlet rows;\nlet w = 8;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  columns = floor(width / w);\n  rows = floor(height / w);\n  board = create2DArray(columns, rows);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      board[i][j] = floor(random(2));\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      fill(255 - board[i][j] * 255);\n      stroke(0);\n      square(i * w, j * w, w);\n    }\n  }\n\n  generate();\n}\n\nfunction generate() {\n  let next = create2DArray(columns, rows);\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < columns - 1; i++) {\n    for (let j = 1; j < rows - 1; j++) {\n      let neighborSum = 0;\n      for (let k = -1; k <= 1; k++) {\n        for (let l = -1; l <= 1; l++) {\n          neighborSum += board[i + k][j + l];\n        }\n      }\n      neighborSum -= board[i][j];\n\n      if (board[i][j] === 1 && neighborSum < 2) {\n        next[i][j] = 0;\n      } else if (board[i][j] === 1 && neighborSum > 3) {\n        next[i][j] = 0;\n      } else if (board[i][j] === 0 && neighborSum === 3) {\n        next[i][j] = 1;\n      } else {\n        next[i][j] = board[i][j];\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  board = next;\n}\n\nfunction create2DArray(columns, rows) {\n  let arr = new Array(columns);\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    arr[i] = new Array(rows);\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      arr[i][j] = 0;\n    }\n  }\n  return arr;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n绘制颜色使用 =255 - board[i][j] * 255=. 状态 0 得到 255, 即白色, 状态 1 得到 0, 即黑色.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let board;\nlet columns;\nlet rows;\nlet w = 8;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  columns = floor(width / w);\n  rows = floor(height / w);\n  board = create2DArray(columns, rows);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      board[i][j] = floor(random(2));\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      fill(255 - board[i][j] * 255);\n      stroke(0);\n      square(i * w, j * w, w);\n    }\n  }\n\n  generate();\n}\n\nfunction generate() {\n  let next = create2DArray(columns, rows);\n\n  for (let i = 1; i < columns - 1; i++) {\n    for (let j = 1; j < rows - 1; j++) {\n      let neighborSum = 0;\n      for (let k = -1; k <= 1; k++) {\n        for (let l = -1; l <= 1; l++) {\n          neighborSum += board[i + k][j + l];\n        }\n      }\n      neighborSum -= board[i][j];\n\n      if (board[i][j] === 1 && neighborSum < 2) {\n        next[i][j] = 0;\n      } else if (board[i][j] === 1 && neighborSum > 3) {\n        next[i][j] = 0;\n      } else if (board[i][j] === 0 && neighborSum === 3) {\n        next[i][j] = 1;\n      } else {\n        next[i][j] = board[i][j];\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  board = next;\n}\n\nfunction create2DArray(columns, rows) {\n  let arr = new Array(columns);\n  for (let i = 0; i < columns; i++) {\n    arr[i] = new Array(rows);\n    for (let j = 0; j < rows; j++) {\n      arr[i][j] = 0;\n    }\n  }\n  return arr;\n}\n"]]} {:id "7.3" :title "面向对象的生命游戏" :chapter 7 :org "*** 示例 7.3: 面向对象的生命游戏\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-7-3-object-oriented-game-of-life\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 431-432\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 7.3, 出生元胞显示为蓝色, 刚死亡元胞显示为红色, 其他存活和死亡元胞显示为黑白. PDF 第 431 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-431-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nshow() {\n  stroke(0);\n\n  if (this.previous === 0 && this.state === 1) {\n    fill(0, 0, 255);\n  } else if (this.state === 1) {\n    fill(0);\n  } else if (this.previous === 1 && this.state === 0) {\n    fill(255, 0, 0);\n  } else {\n    fill(255);\n  }\n\n  square(this.x, this.y, this.w);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n计算规则时应读取邻居的 =previous=, 然后写入当前 =state=:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfor (let x = 1; x < columns - 1; x++) {\n  for (let y = 1; y < rows - 1; y++) {\n    let neighborSum = 0;\n\n    for (let i = -1; i <= 1; i++) {\n      for (let j = -1; j <= 1; j++) {\n        neighborSum += board[x + i][y + j].previous;\n      }\n    }\n\n    neighborSum -= board[x][y].previous;\n\n    if (board[x][y].state === 1 && neighborSum < 2) {\n      board[x][y].state = 0;\n    } else if (board[x][y].state === 1 && neighborSum > 3) {\n      board[x][y].state = 0;\n    } else if (board[x][y].state === 0 && neighborSum === 3) {\n      board[x][y].state = 1;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n对象化之后, 元胞可以拥有 =lifespan=, =terrain= 或移动速度等属性. 例如地形元胞可取 =land=, =water=, =mountain= 或 =forest=, 从而把二维 CA 融入策略游戏和生态模拟.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "show() {\n  stroke(0);\n\n  if (this.previous === 0 && this.state === 1) {\n    fill(0, 0, 255);\n  } else if (this.state === 1) {\n    fill(0);\n  } else if (this.previous === 1 && this.state === 0) {\n    fill(255, 0, 0);\n  } else {\n    fill(255);\n  }\n\n  square(this.x, this.y, this.w);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "for (let x = 1; x < columns - 1; x++) {\n  for (let y = 1; y < rows - 1; y++) {\n    let neighborSum = 0;\n\n    for (let i = -1; i <= 1; i++) {\n      for (let j = -1; j <= 1; j++) {\n        neighborSum += board[x + i][y + j].previous;\n      }\n    }\n\n    neighborSum -= board[x][y].previous;\n\n    if (board[x][y].state === 1 && neighborSum < 2) {\n      board[x][y].state = 0;\n    } else if (board[x][y].state === 1 && neighborSum > 3) {\n      board[x][y].state = 0;\n    } else if (board[x][y].state === 0 && neighborSum === 3) {\n      board[x][y].state = 1;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.1" :title "一次递归的同心圆" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.1: 一次递归的同心圆\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-1-recursive-circles-once\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 445-445\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.1, 半径逐次缩小的同心圆. PDF 第 445 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-445-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction drawCircles(x, y, r) {\n  circle(x, y, r * 2);\n  if (r > 4) {\n    r *= 0.75;\n    drawCircles(x, y, r);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n函数先绘制当前圆, 然后在半径仍大于 4 时缩小半径并调用自己. 结果是一组逐渐向中心收缩的圆. 这个例子也可以用循环实现, 但它建立了图形递归的基本形态.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function drawCircles(x, y, r) {\n  circle(x, y, r * 2);\n  if (r > 4) {\n    r *= 0.75;\n    drawCircles(x, y, r);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.2" :title "每个圆递归两次" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.2: 每个圆递归两次\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-2-recursive-circles-twice\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 446-446\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.2, 每个圆在左右两侧生成两个更小的圆. PDF 第 446 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-446-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  drawCircles(width / 2, height / 2, 320);\n}\n\nfunction drawCircles(x, y, radius) {\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  circle(x, y, radius * 2);\n  if (radius > 4) {\n    drawCircles(x + radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x - radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n一个函数在每层调用自身两次后, 递归树开始分叉. 每个圆产生左右两个子圆, 子圆再继续生成更小的子圆.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  drawCircles(width / 2, height / 2, 320);\n}\n\nfunction drawCircles(x, y, radius) {\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  circle(x, y, radius * 2);\n  if (radius > 4) {\n    drawCircles(x + radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x - radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.3" :title "每个圆递归四次" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.3: 每个圆递归四次\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-3-recursive-circles-four-times\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 447-447\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.3, 每个圆分别在左, 右, 上, 下生成四个子圆. PDF 第 447 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-447-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction drawCircles(x, y, radius) {\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  circle(x, y, radius * 2);\n  if (radius > 16) {\n    drawCircles(x + radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x - radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x, y + radius / 2, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x, y - radius / 2, radius / 2);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n仅增加两次递归调用, 图案复杂度就迅速上升. 若每层调用 \\(b\\) 次并递归 \\(d\\) 层, 节点数量大致按 \\(b^d\\) 增长. 因此退出阈值不仅决定视觉细节, 也直接决定性能.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function drawCircles(x, y, radius) {\n  stroke(0);\n  noFill();\n  circle(x, y, radius * 2);\n  if (radius > 16) {\n    drawCircles(x + radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x - radius / 2, y, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x, y + radius / 2, radius / 2);\n    drawCircles(x, y - radius / 2, radius / 2);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.4" :title "Cantor 集" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.4: Cantor 集\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-4-the-cantor-set\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 450-450\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.4, 使用两个递归调用生成的 Cantor 集. PDF 第 450 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-450-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction cantor(x, y, length) {\n  if (length > 1) {\n    line(x, y, x + length, y);\n    cantor(x, y + 20, length / 3);\n    cantor(x + (2 * length) / 3, y + 20, length / 3);\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n这个函数非常简洁, 但它只负责立即绘制图形. 若希望每条线段成为能够独立运动, 受力或改变样式的对象, 就需要把递归生成过程与对象数组结合. Koch 曲线将采用这种结构.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function cantor(x, y, length) {\n  if (length > 1) {\n    line(x, y, x + length, y);\n    cantor(x, y + 20, length / 3);\n    cantor(x + (2 * length) / 3, y + 20, length / 3);\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.5" :title "Koch 曲线" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.5: Koch 曲线\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-5-the-koch-curve\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 457-457\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.5, 迭代五次后的 Koch 曲线. PDF 第 457 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-457-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet segments = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let start = createVector(0, 200);\n  let end = createVector(width, 200);\n  segments.push(new KochLine(start, end));\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n    generate();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  for (let segment of segments) {\n    segment.show();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n每次迭代都把一条线变成四条. 五次迭代后共有 \\(4^5=1024\\) 条线段. 也可以使用最小线长作为停止条件, 或提供按钮让用户逐代生成.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let segments = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let start = createVector(0, 200);\n  let end = createVector(width, 200);\n  segments.push(new KochLine(start, end));\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 5; i++) {\n    generate();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  for (let segment of segments) {\n    segment.show();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.6" :title "递归树" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.6: 递归树\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-6-a-recursive-tree\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 464-464\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.6, 鼠标横坐标控制分枝角度的确定性递归树. PDF 第 464 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-464-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet angle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  angle = map(mouseX, 0, width, 0, HALF_PI);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height);\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  branch(80);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n递归函数用很少代码生成完整树形, 但立即绘制的方式限制了动画能力. 若改用 =Branch= 对象数组保存每条枝条, 就能逐步生长, 改变颜色, 施加力或连接弹簧.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let angle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  angle = map(mouseX, 0, width, 0, HALF_PI);\n\n  translate(width / 2, height);\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  branch(80);\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.7" :title "随机树" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.7: 随机树\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-7-a-stochastic-tree\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 466-466\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.7, 分枝数量和角度均随机的随机分形树. PDF 第 466 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-466-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction branch(length) {\n  line(0, 0, 0, -length);\n  translate(0, -length);\n\n  length *= 0.67;\n\n  if (length > 2) {\n    let n = Math.floor(random(1, 4));\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      let angle = random(-PI / 2, PI / 2);\n      push();\n      rotate(angle);\n      branch(length);\n      pop();\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n完全均匀的宽角度随机仍可能显得杂乱. 更自然的结果往往需要缩小角度范围, 让左右方向具有偏好, 或用 Perlin noise 让相邻枝条的变化更加平滑.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function branch(length) {\n  line(0, 0, 0, -length);\n  translate(0, -length);\n\n  length *= 0.67;\n\n  if (length > 2) {\n    let n = Math.floor(random(1, 4));\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n      let angle = random(-PI / 2, PI / 2);\n      push();\n      rotate(angle);\n      branch(length);\n      pop();\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.8" :title "简单 L-system 句子生成" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.8: 简单 L-system 句子生成\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-8-simple-lsystem-sentence-generation\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 469-470\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.8, 在画布中显示 L-system 的九个世代. PDF 第 469 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-469-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet current = \"A\";\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 160);\n  background(255);\n  noLoop();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {\n    generate();\n    textSize(16);\n    textFont(\"courier\");\n    text(i + \": \" + current, 4, 20 + i * 16);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction generate() {\n  let next = \"\";\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < current.length; i++) {\n    let c = current.charAt(i);\n\n    if (c === \"A\") {\n      next += \"AB\";\n    } else if (c === \"B\") {\n      next += \"A\";\n    }\n  }\n\n  current = next;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n字符串本身还不是植物. 要把文法变成图形, 需要把字符解释为绘图命令. 例如使用另一个系统:\n\n- Alphabet: =A, B=.\n- Axiom: =A=.\n- Rules: \\(A\\rightarrow ABA\\), \\(B\\rightarrow BBB\\).\n- =A=: 向前画线.\n- =B=: 向前移动但不画线.\n\n把句子逐字符执行后, 会得到 Cantor 集.\n\n#+CAPTION: 图 8.21, 使用 L-system 字母表和绘图解释生成 Cantor 集. PDF 第 471 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-471-image-01.jpeg]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let current = \"A\";\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 160);\n  background(255);\n  noLoop();\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 9; i++) {\n    generate();\n    textSize(16);\n    textFont(\"courier\");\n    text(i + \": \" + current, 4, 20 + i * 16);\n  }\n}\n\nfunction generate() {\n  let next = \"\";\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < current.length; i++) {\n    let c = current.charAt(i);\n\n    if (c === \"A\") {\n      next += \"AB\";\n    } else if (c === \"B\") {\n      next += \"A\";\n    }\n  }\n\n  current = next;\n}\n"]]} {:id "8.9" :title "一个 L-system" :chapter 8 :org "*** 示例 8.9: 一个 L-system\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-8-9-an-lsystem\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 473-474\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 8.9, 使用四代 L-system 字符串和 turtle graphics 绘制的植物结构. PDF 第 473 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-473-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet lsystem;\nlet turtle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let rules = {\n    \"F\": \"FF+[+F-F-F]-[-F+F+F]\",\n  };\n\n  lsystem = new LSystem(\"F\", rules);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n    lsystem.generate();\n  }\n\n  turtle = new Turtle(4, radians(25));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height);\n  turtle.render(lsystem.sentence);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=rules= 使用对象字面量而不是单独的 =Rule= 类. 键 =\"F\"= 表示需要替换的字符, 值 =\"FF+[+F-F-F]-[-F+F+F]\"= 是替换结果. 若有多个 predecessor, 可以继续添加键值对.\n\n为使示例结构完整, =LSystem= 的核心逻辑可写成:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass LSystem {\n  constructor(axiom, rules) {\n    this.sentence = axiom;\n    this.rules = rules;\n  }\n\n  generate() {\n    let next = \"\";\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sentence.length; i++) {\n      let c = this.sentence.charAt(i);\n      next += this.rules[c] ?? c;\n    }\n\n    this.sentence = next;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=Turtle= 的核心解释器可写成:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Turtle {\n  constructor(length, angle) {\n    this.length = length;\n    this.angle = angle;\n  }\n\n  render(sentence) {\n    stroke(0);\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < sentence.length; i++) {\n      let c = sentence.charAt(i);\n\n      if (c === \"F\") {\n        line(0, 0, 0, -this.length);\n        translate(0, -this.length);\n      } else if (c === \"G\") {\n        translate(0, -this.length);\n      } else if (c === \"+\") {\n        rotate(this.angle);\n      } else if (c === \"-\") {\n        rotate(-this.angle);\n      } else if (c === \"[\") {\n        push();\n      } else if (c === \"]\") {\n        pop();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let lsystem;\nlet turtle;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let rules = {\n    \"F\": \"FF+[+F-F-F]-[-F+F+F]\",\n  };\n\n  lsystem = new LSystem(\"F\", rules);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 4; i++) {\n    lsystem.generate();\n  }\n\n  turtle = new Turtle(4, radians(25));\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height);\n  turtle.render(lsystem.sentence);\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "class LSystem {\n  constructor(axiom, rules) {\n    this.sentence = axiom;\n    this.rules = rules;\n  }\n\n  generate() {\n    let next = \"\";\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.sentence.length; i++) {\n      let c = this.sentence.charAt(i);\n      next += this.rules[c] ?? c;\n    }\n\n    this.sentence = next;\n  }\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "class Turtle {\n  constructor(length, angle) {\n    this.length = length;\n    this.angle = angle;\n  }\n\n  render(sentence) {\n    stroke(0);\n\n    for (let i = 0; i < sentence.length; i++) {\n      let c = sentence.charAt(i);\n\n      if (c === \"F\") {\n        line(0, 0, 0, -this.length);\n        translate(0, -this.length);\n      } else if (c === \"G\") {\n        translate(0, -this.length);\n      } else if (c === \"+\") {\n        rotate(this.angle);\n      } else if (c === \"-\") {\n        rotate(-this.angle);\n      } else if (c === \"[\") {\n        push();\n      } else if (c === \"]\") {\n        pop();\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "9.1" :title "进化 Shakespeare 短语" :chapter 9 :org "*** 示例 9.1: 进化 Shakespeare 短语\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-9-1-evolving-shakespeare\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 499-502\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 9.1 的早期种群. 各候选短语已出现局部正确字符, 但整体仍很混乱. PDF 第 499 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-499-image-01.png]]\n\n下面给出可直接运行的完整 p5.js 版本. 它使用临时数组保存下一代, 同时报告最佳短语, 代数和平均适应度.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nconst target = \"to be or not to be\";\nconst mutationRate = 0.01;\nconst populationSize = 200;\n\nlet population = [];\nlet generation = 0;\nlet solved = false;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  textFont(\"monospace\");\n  for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n    population.push(new DNA(target.length));\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let totalFitness = 0;\n  let best = population[0];\n  for (let phrase of population) {\n    phrase.calculateFitness(target);\n    totalFitness += phrase.fitness;\n    if (phrase.fitness > best.fitness) best = phrase;\n  }\n\n  fill(0);\n  textSize(24);\n  text(\"Best phrase:\", 20, 40);\n  text(best.getPhrase(), 20, 75);\n  textSize(14);\n  text(`generation: ${generation}`, 20, 110);\n  text(`average fitness: ${(totalFitness / population.length).toFixed(4)}`, 20, 130);\n\n  let y = 165;\n  for (let i = 0; i < min(18, population.length); i++) {\n    text(population[i].getPhrase(), 20 + floor(i / 9) * 260, y + (i % 9) * 18);\n  }\n\n  if (best.getPhrase() === target) {\n    solved = true;\n    noLoop();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let matingPool = [];\n  for (let phrase of population) {\n    let copies = floor(phrase.fitness * 100);\n    for (let i = 0; i < copies; i++) matingPool.push(phrase);\n  }\n\n  // 极少数情况下全部适应度为 0, 使用原种群作为回退交配池.\n  if (matingPool.length === 0) matingPool = population.slice();\n\n  let nextPopulation = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n    let parentA = random(matingPool);\n    let parentB = random(matingPool);\n    let child = parentA.crossover(parentB);\n    child.mutate(mutationRate);\n    nextPopulation.push(child);\n  }\n\n  population = nextPopulation;\n  generation++;\n}\n\nclass DNA {\n  constructor(length, genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : [];\n    if (!genes) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < length; i++) this.genes[i] = randomCharacter();\n    }\n    this.fitness = 0;\n  }\n\n  getPhrase() {\n    return this.genes.join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  calculateFitness(targetText) {\n    let score = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (this.genes[i] === targetText.charAt(i)) score++;\n    }\n    this.fitness = score / targetText.length;\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let childGenes = new Array(this.genes.length);\n    let midpoint = floor(random(this.genes.length));\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      childGenes[i] = i < midpoint ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i];\n    }\n    return new DNA(this.genes.length, childGenes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) this.genes[i] = randomCharacter();\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction randomCharacter() {\n  return String.fromCharCode(floor(random(32, 127)));\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 经过若干代后, 最佳短语逐渐接近目标, 同时显示总世代数, 平均适应度, 种群规模和变异率. PDF 第 502 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-502-image-01.png]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "const target = \"to be or not to be\";\nconst mutationRate = 0.01;\nconst populationSize = 200;\n\nlet population = [];\nlet generation = 0;\nlet solved = false;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  textFont(\"monospace\");\n  for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n    population.push(new DNA(target.length));\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  let totalFitness = 0;\n  let best = population[0];\n  for (let phrase of population) {\n    phrase.calculateFitness(target);\n    totalFitness += phrase.fitness;\n    if (phrase.fitness > best.fitness) best = phrase;\n  }\n\n  fill(0);\n  textSize(24);\n  text(\"Best phrase:\", 20, 40);\n  text(best.getPhrase(), 20, 75);\n  textSize(14);\n  text(`generation: ${generation}`, 20, 110);\n  text(`average fitness: ${(totalFitness / population.length).toFixed(4)}`, 20, 130);\n\n  let y = 165;\n  for (let i = 0; i < min(18, population.length); i++) {\n    text(population[i].getPhrase(), 20 + floor(i / 9) * 260, y + (i % 9) * 18);\n  }\n\n  if (best.getPhrase() === target) {\n    solved = true;\n    noLoop();\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let matingPool = [];\n  for (let phrase of population) {\n    let copies = floor(phrase.fitness * 100);\n    for (let i = 0; i < copies; i++) matingPool.push(phrase);\n  }\n\n  // 极少数情况下全部适应度为 0, 使用原种群作为回退交配池.\n  if (matingPool.length === 0) matingPool = population.slice();\n\n  let nextPopulation = [];\n  for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n    let parentA = random(matingPool);\n    let parentB = random(matingPool);\n    let child = parentA.crossover(parentB);\n    child.mutate(mutationRate);\n    nextPopulation.push(child);\n  }\n\n  population = nextPopulation;\n  generation++;\n}\n\nclass DNA {\n  constructor(length, genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : [];\n    if (!genes) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < length; i++) this.genes[i] = randomCharacter();\n    }\n    this.fitness = 0;\n  }\n\n  getPhrase() {\n    return this.genes.join(\"\");\n  }\n\n  calculateFitness(targetText) {\n    let score = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (this.genes[i] === targetText.charAt(i)) score++;\n    }\n    this.fitness = score / targetText.length;\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let childGenes = new Array(this.genes.length);\n    let midpoint = floor(random(this.genes.length));\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      childGenes[i] = i < midpoint ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i];\n    }\n    return new DNA(this.genes.length, childGenes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) this.genes[i] = randomCharacter();\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nfunction randomCharacter() {\n  return String.fromCharCode(floor(random(32, 127)));\n}\n"]]} {:id "9.2" :title "智能火箭" :chapter 9 :org "*** 示例 9.2: 智能火箭\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-9-2-smart-rockets\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 511-519\n:END:\n\n下面是一个完整的单障碍版本. 每代持续 =lifeSpan= 帧, 然后按目标距离, 是否完成和完成时间计算适应度.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nconst populationSize = 100;\nconst lifeSpan = 250;\nconst mutationRate = 0.01;\nconst maxForce = 0.2;\n\nlet population;\nlet target;\nlet obstacle;\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  target = createVector(width / 2, 35);\n  obstacle = { x: width * 0.25, y: height * 0.48, w: width * 0.5, h: 18 };\n  population = new Population(populationSize);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  fill(120);\n  noStroke();\n  rect(obstacle.x, obstacle.y, obstacle.w, obstacle.h);\n  fill(80);\n  circle(target.x, target.y, 24);\n\n  population.run(count);\n  count++;\n\n  fill(0);\n  text(`generation: ${population.generation}`, 10, 20);\n  text(`cycles left: ${lifeSpan - count}`, 10, 40);\n\n  if (count === lifeSpan) {\n    population.evaluate();\n    population.reproduce();\n    count = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nclass DNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.map(v => v.copy()) : [];\n    if (!genes) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < lifeSpan; i++) {\n        let force = p5.Vector.random2D();\n        force.setMag(random(maxForce));\n        this.genes.push(force);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let midpoint = floor(random(this.genes.length));\n    let childGenes = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      childGenes[i] = (i < midpoint ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i]).copy();\n    }\n    return new DNA(childGenes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) {\n        let force = p5.Vector.random2D();\n        force.setMag(random(maxForce));\n        this.genes[i] = force;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Rocket {\n  constructor(dna = new DNA()) {\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height - 20);\n    this.velocity = createVector();\n    this.acceleration = createVector();\n    this.fitness = 0;\n    this.completed = false;\n    this.crashed = false;\n    this.finishTime = lifeSpan;\n    this.recordDistance = Infinity;\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  run(geneIndex) {\n    let distance = p5.Vector.dist(this.position, target);\n    this.recordDistance = min(this.recordDistance, distance);\n\n    if (distance < 12) {\n      this.completed = true;\n      this.finishTime = min(this.finishTime, geneIndex);\n      this.position = target.copy();\n    }\n\n    let insideObstacle =\n      this.position.x > obstacle.x &&\n      this.position.x < obstacle.x + obstacle.w &&\n      this.position.y > obstacle.y &&\n      this.position.y < obstacle.y + obstacle.h;\n\n    let outside = this.position.x < 0 || this.position.x > width ||\n                  this.position.y < 0 || this.position.y > height;\n    if (insideObstacle || outside) this.crashed = true;\n\n    if (!this.completed && !this.crashed) {\n      this.applyForce(this.dna.genes[geneIndex]);\n      this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n      this.velocity.limit(6);\n      this.position.add(this.velocity);\n      this.acceleration.mult(0);\n    }\n\n    this.show();\n  }\n\n  calculateFitness() {\n    let d = max(1, this.recordDistance);\n    this.fitness = 1 / (d * d);\n    if (this.completed) {\n      this.fitness *= 10 + (lifeSpan - this.finishTime) / lifeSpan * 10;\n    }\n    if (this.crashed) this.fitness *= 0.1;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n    rotate(this.velocity.heading() + HALF_PI);\n    stroke(0, 80);\n    fill(180, 120);\n    triangle(-5, 8, 5, 8, 0, -12);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n\nclass Population {\n  constructor(size) {\n    this.rockets = [];\n    this.generation = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < size; i++) this.rockets.push(new Rocket());\n  }\n\n  run(geneIndex) {\n    for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.run(geneIndex);\n  }\n\n  evaluate() {\n    let sum = 0;\n    for (let rocket of this.rockets) {\n      rocket.calculateFitness();\n      sum += rocket.fitness;\n    }\n    if (sum === 0) {\n      let equal = 1 / this.rockets.length;\n      for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.fitness = equal;\n    } else {\n      for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.fitness /= sum;\n    }\n  }\n\n  selectParent() {\n    let r = random(1);\n    let index = 0;\n    while (r > 0 && index < this.rockets.length) {\n      r -= this.rockets[index].fitness;\n      index++;\n    }\n    return this.rockets[max(0, index - 1)];\n  }\n\n  reproduce() {\n    let next = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.rockets.length; i++) {\n      let parentA = this.selectParent();\n      let parentB = this.selectParent();\n      let childDNA = parentA.dna.crossover(parentB.dna);\n      childDNA.mutate(mutationRate);\n      next.push(new Rocket(childDNA));\n    }\n    this.rockets = next;\n    this.generation++;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 9.2, 一代火箭按照各自 DNA 的推力序列飞行, 逐渐向目标聚集. PDF 第 517 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-517-image-01.png]]\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "const populationSize = 100;\nconst lifeSpan = 250;\nconst mutationRate = 0.01;\nconst maxForce = 0.2;\n\nlet population;\nlet target;\nlet obstacle;\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 360);\n  target = createVector(width / 2, 35);\n  obstacle = { x: width * 0.25, y: height * 0.48, w: width * 0.5, h: 18 };\n  population = new Population(populationSize);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  fill(120);\n  noStroke();\n  rect(obstacle.x, obstacle.y, obstacle.w, obstacle.h);\n  fill(80);\n  circle(target.x, target.y, 24);\n\n  population.run(count);\n  count++;\n\n  fill(0);\n  text(`generation: ${population.generation}`, 10, 20);\n  text(`cycles left: ${lifeSpan - count}`, 10, 40);\n\n  if (count === lifeSpan) {\n    population.evaluate();\n    population.reproduce();\n    count = 0;\n  }\n}\n\nclass DNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.map(v => v.copy()) : [];\n    if (!genes) {\n      for (let i = 0; i < lifeSpan; i++) {\n        let force = p5.Vector.random2D();\n        force.setMag(random(maxForce));\n        this.genes.push(force);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let midpoint = floor(random(this.genes.length));\n    let childGenes = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      childGenes[i] = (i < midpoint ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i]).copy();\n    }\n    return new DNA(childGenes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) {\n        let force = p5.Vector.random2D();\n        force.setMag(random(maxForce));\n        this.genes[i] = force;\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Rocket {\n  constructor(dna = new DNA()) {\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.position = createVector(width / 2, height - 20);\n    this.velocity = createVector();\n    this.acceleration = createVector();\n    this.fitness = 0;\n    this.completed = false;\n    this.crashed = false;\n    this.finishTime = lifeSpan;\n    this.recordDistance = Infinity;\n  }\n\n  applyForce(force) {\n    this.acceleration.add(force);\n  }\n\n  run(geneIndex) {\n    let distance = p5.Vector.dist(this.position, target);\n    this.recordDistance = min(this.recordDistance, distance);\n\n    if (distance < 12) {\n      this.completed = true;\n      this.finishTime = min(this.finishTime, geneIndex);\n      this.position = target.copy();\n    }\n\n    let insideObstacle =\n      this.position.x > obstacle.x &&\n      this.position.x < obstacle.x + obstacle.w &&\n      this.position.y > obstacle.y &&\n      this.position.y < obstacle.y + obstacle.h;\n\n    let outside = this.position.x < 0 || this.position.x > width ||\n                  this.position.y < 0 || this.position.y > height;\n    if (insideObstacle || outside) this.crashed = true;\n\n    if (!this.completed && !this.crashed) {\n      this.applyForce(this.dna.genes[geneIndex]);\n      this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n      this.velocity.limit(6);\n      this.position.add(this.velocity);\n      this.acceleration.mult(0);\n    }\n\n    this.show();\n  }\n\n  calculateFitness() {\n    let d = max(1, this.recordDistance);\n    this.fitness = 1 / (d * d);\n    if (this.completed) {\n      this.fitness *= 10 + (lifeSpan - this.finishTime) / lifeSpan * 10;\n    }\n    if (this.crashed) this.fitness *= 0.1;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n    rotate(this.velocity.heading() + HALF_PI);\n    stroke(0, 80);\n    fill(180, 120);\n    triangle(-5, 8, 5, 8, 0, -12);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n\nclass Population {\n  constructor(size) {\n    this.rockets = [];\n    this.generation = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < size; i++) this.rockets.push(new Rocket());\n  }\n\n  run(geneIndex) {\n    for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.run(geneIndex);\n  }\n\n  evaluate() {\n    let sum = 0;\n    for (let rocket of this.rockets) {\n      rocket.calculateFitness();\n      sum += rocket.fitness;\n    }\n    if (sum === 0) {\n      let equal = 1 / this.rockets.length;\n      for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.fitness = equal;\n    } else {\n      for (let rocket of this.rockets) rocket.fitness /= sum;\n    }\n  }\n\n  selectParent() {\n    let r = random(1);\n    let index = 0;\n    while (r > 0 && index < this.rockets.length) {\n      r -= this.rockets[index].fitness;\n      index++;\n    }\n    return this.rockets[max(0, index - 1)];\n  }\n\n  reproduce() {\n    let next = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.rockets.length; i++) {\n      let parentA = this.selectParent();\n      let parentB = this.selectParent();\n      let childDNA = parentA.dna.crossover(parentB.dna);\n      childDNA.mutate(mutationRate);\n      next.push(new Rocket(childDNA));\n    }\n    this.rockets = next;\n    this.generation++;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "9.4" :title "交互式花朵选择" :chapter 9 :org "*** 示例 9.4: 交互式花朵选择\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-9-4-interactive-selection\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 523-526\n:END:\n\n以下代码展示核心机制. 鼠标停留在某朵花上时, 其适应度持续增加. 按按钮后生成下一代.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nconst flowerCount = 8;\nconst flowerMutationRate = 0.05;\nlet flowerPopulation;\nlet evolveButton;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  colorMode(RGB, 1);\n  flowerPopulation = new FlowerPopulation(flowerCount);\n  evolveButton = createButton(\"evolve new generation\");\n  evolveButton.position(10, 210);\n  evolveButton.mousePressed(() => flowerPopulation.nextGeneration());\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(1);\n  flowerPopulation.show();\n  flowerPopulation.rollover(mouseX, mouseY);\n  fill(0);\n  text(`Generation ${flowerPopulation.generation}`, 12, height - 40);\n}\n\nclass FlowerDNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : Array.from({ length: 14 }, () => random(1));\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let child = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      child[i] = random(1) < 0.5 ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i];\n    }\n    return new FlowerDNA(child);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) this.genes[i] = random(1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Flower {\n  constructor(x, dna = new FlowerDNA()) {\n    this.x = x;\n    this.y = 170;\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.fitness = 1;\n    this.w = 64;\n  }\n\n  contains(mx, my) {\n    return mx > this.x - this.w / 2 && mx < this.x + this.w / 2 &&\n           my > 40 && my < 190;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let g = this.dna.genes;\n    let petalColor = color(g[0], g[1], g[2], g[3]);\n    let petalSize = map(g[4], 0, 1, 4, 24);\n    let petalCount = floor(map(g[5], 0, 1, 2, 16));\n    let centerColor = color(g[6], g[7], g[8]);\n    let centerSize = map(g[9], 0, 1, 24, 48);\n    let stemColor = color(g[10], g[11], g[12]);\n    let stemLength = map(g[13], 0, 1, 50, 100);\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.x, this.y);\n    stroke(stemColor);\n    strokeWeight(4);\n    line(0, 0, 0, -stemLength);\n    translate(0, -stemLength);\n    noStroke();\n    fill(petalColor);\n    for (let i = 0; i < petalCount; i++) {\n      let angle = TWO_PI * i / petalCount;\n      circle(cos(angle) * centerSize * 0.55,\n             sin(angle) * centerSize * 0.55,\n             petalSize);\n    }\n    fill(centerColor);\n    circle(0, 0, centerSize);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n\nclass FlowerPopulation {\n  constructor(size) {\n    this.generation = 0;\n    this.flowers = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n      this.flowers.push(new Flower(45 + i * 78));\n    }\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) flower.show();\n  }\n\n  rollover(mx, my) {\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) {\n      if (flower.contains(mx, my)) flower.fitness += 0.25;\n    }\n  }\n\n  chooseParent() {\n    let total = this.flowers.reduce((sum, f) => sum + f.fitness, 0);\n    let r = random(total);\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) {\n      r -= flower.fitness;\n      if (r <= 0) return flower;\n    }\n    return this.flowers[this.flowers.length - 1];\n  }\n\n  nextGeneration() {\n    let next = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.flowers.length; i++) {\n      let a = this.chooseParent();\n      let b = this.chooseParent();\n      let dna = a.dna.crossover(b.dna);\n      dna.mutate(flowerMutationRate);\n      next.push(new Flower(45 + i * 78, dna));\n    }\n    this.flowers = next;\n    this.generation++;\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 9.4, 八朵候选花和各自累积的交互评分. 点击按钮后按评分生成下一代. PDF 第 525 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-525-image-01.png]]\n\n交互式选择的主要瓶颈是时间. 程序可以每秒产生许多代, 但人类无法快速评价大种群. 可通过隐式行为信号, 多用户协作, 分布式 Web 应用或传感器减少评价负担.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "const flowerCount = 8;\nconst flowerMutationRate = 0.05;\nlet flowerPopulation;\nlet evolveButton;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  colorMode(RGB, 1);\n  flowerPopulation = new FlowerPopulation(flowerCount);\n  evolveButton = createButton(\"evolve new generation\");\n  evolveButton.position(10, 210);\n  evolveButton.mousePressed(() => flowerPopulation.nextGeneration());\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(1);\n  flowerPopulation.show();\n  flowerPopulation.rollover(mouseX, mouseY);\n  fill(0);\n  text(`Generation ${flowerPopulation.generation}`, 12, height - 40);\n}\n\nclass FlowerDNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : Array.from({ length: 14 }, () => random(1));\n  }\n\n  crossover(partner) {\n    let child = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      child[i] = random(1) < 0.5 ? this.genes[i] : partner.genes[i];\n    }\n    return new FlowerDNA(child);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.genes.length; i++) {\n      if (random(1) < rate) this.genes[i] = random(1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass Flower {\n  constructor(x, dna = new FlowerDNA()) {\n    this.x = x;\n    this.y = 170;\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.fitness = 1;\n    this.w = 64;\n  }\n\n  contains(mx, my) {\n    return mx > this.x - this.w / 2 && mx < this.x + this.w / 2 &&\n           my > 40 && my < 190;\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    let g = this.dna.genes;\n    let petalColor = color(g[0], g[1], g[2], g[3]);\n    let petalSize = map(g[4], 0, 1, 4, 24);\n    let petalCount = floor(map(g[5], 0, 1, 2, 16));\n    let centerColor = color(g[6], g[7], g[8]);\n    let centerSize = map(g[9], 0, 1, 24, 48);\n    let stemColor = color(g[10], g[11], g[12]);\n    let stemLength = map(g[13], 0, 1, 50, 100);\n\n    push();\n    translate(this.x, this.y);\n    stroke(stemColor);\n    strokeWeight(4);\n    line(0, 0, 0, -stemLength);\n    translate(0, -stemLength);\n    noStroke();\n    fill(petalColor);\n    for (let i = 0; i < petalCount; i++) {\n      let angle = TWO_PI * i / petalCount;\n      circle(cos(angle) * centerSize * 0.55,\n             sin(angle) * centerSize * 0.55,\n             petalSize);\n    }\n    fill(centerColor);\n    circle(0, 0, centerSize);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n\nclass FlowerPopulation {\n  constructor(size) {\n    this.generation = 0;\n    this.flowers = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < size; i++) {\n      this.flowers.push(new Flower(45 + i * 78));\n    }\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) flower.show();\n  }\n\n  rollover(mx, my) {\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) {\n      if (flower.contains(mx, my)) flower.fitness += 0.25;\n    }\n  }\n\n  chooseParent() {\n    let total = this.flowers.reduce((sum, f) => sum + f.fitness, 0);\n    let r = random(total);\n    for (let flower of this.flowers) {\n      r -= flower.fitness;\n      if (r <= 0) return flower;\n    }\n    return this.flowers[this.flowers.length - 1];\n  }\n\n  nextGeneration() {\n    let next = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.flowers.length; i++) {\n      let a = this.chooseParent();\n      let b = this.chooseParent();\n      let dna = a.dna.crossover(b.dna);\n      dna.mutate(flowerMutationRate);\n      next.push(new Flower(45 + i * 78, dna));\n    }\n    this.flowers = next;\n    this.generation++;\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "9.5" :title "进化生态系统" :chapter 9 :org "*** 示例 9.5: 进化生态系统\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-9-5-evolving-ecosystem\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 528-534\n:END:\n\n以下代码给出核心可运行实现. Bloop 使用随机转向探索环境, 食物被吃掉或由死亡个体的位置补充.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet world;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  world = new World(20);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  world.run();\n}\n\nclass Bloop {\n  constructor(position, dna = new BloopDNA()) {\n    this.position = position.copy();\n    this.velocity = p5.Vector.random2D();\n    this.acceleration = createVector();\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.maxSpeed = map(dna.genes[0], 0, 1, 8, 0.3);\n    this.radius = map(dna.genes[0], 0, 1, 3, 24);\n    this.health = 100;\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    let wander = p5.Vector.random2D().mult(0.25);\n    this.acceleration.add(wander);\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.maxSpeed);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n\n    this.position.x = (this.position.x + width) % width;\n    this.position.y = (this.position.y + height) % height;\n    this.health -= 0.2;\n\n    noStroke();\n    fill(0, constrain(this.health * 2, 20, 220));\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.radius * 2);\n  }\n\n  eat(foodPositions) {\n    for (let i = foodPositions.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      if (p5.Vector.dist(this.position, foodPositions[i]) < this.radius) {\n        this.health += 80;\n        foodPositions.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  reproduce() {\n    if (random(1) < 0.0005) {\n      let childDNA = this.dna.copy();\n      childDNA.mutate(0.01);\n      return new Bloop(this.position, childDNA);\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  dead() {\n    return this.health < 0;\n  }\n}\n\nclass Food {\n  constructor(count) {\n    this.positions = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) this.add();\n  }\n\n  add(position = null) {\n    this.positions.push(position ? position.copy() : createVector(random(width), random(height)));\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    if (random(1) < 0.02) this.add();\n    fill(100);\n    noStroke();\n    for (let p of this.positions) square(p.x - 2, p.y - 2, 4);\n  }\n}\n\nclass World {\n  constructor(populationSize) {\n    this.bloops = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n      this.bloops.push(new Bloop(createVector(random(width), random(height))));\n    }\n    this.food = new Food(populationSize);\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    this.food.run();\n\n    for (let i = this.bloops.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let bloop = this.bloops[i];\n      bloop.run();\n      bloop.eat(this.food.positions);\n\n      if (bloop.dead()) {\n        this.food.add(bloop.position);\n        this.bloops.splice(i, 1);\n      } else {\n        let child = bloop.reproduce();\n        if (child) this.bloops.push(child);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass BloopDNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : [random(1)];\n  }\n\n  copy() {\n    return new BloopDNA(this.genes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    if (random(1) < rate) {\n      this.genes[0] = constrain(this.genes[0] + randomGaussian(0, 0.1), 0, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 9.5, 不同尺寸和速度的 Bloop 在连续出生, 取食, 繁殖和死亡中形成动态种群. PDF 第 533 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-533-image-01.jpeg]]\n\n该环境通常会逐渐偏向中等体型和中等速度. 大个体太慢, 小个体虽然快速却不容易碰到食物. 中间值在接触范围和移动效率之间取得折中. 随机聚集和食物分布也可能产生短暂异常, 因此进化结果不是一条光滑的确定性曲线.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let world;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  world = new World(20);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  world.run();\n}\n\nclass Bloop {\n  constructor(position, dna = new BloopDNA()) {\n    this.position = position.copy();\n    this.velocity = p5.Vector.random2D();\n    this.acceleration = createVector();\n    this.dna = dna;\n    this.maxSpeed = map(dna.genes[0], 0, 1, 8, 0.3);\n    this.radius = map(dna.genes[0], 0, 1, 3, 24);\n    this.health = 100;\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    let wander = p5.Vector.random2D().mult(0.25);\n    this.acceleration.add(wander);\n    this.velocity.add(this.acceleration);\n    this.velocity.limit(this.maxSpeed);\n    this.position.add(this.velocity);\n    this.acceleration.mult(0);\n\n    this.position.x = (this.position.x + width) % width;\n    this.position.y = (this.position.y + height) % height;\n    this.health -= 0.2;\n\n    noStroke();\n    fill(0, constrain(this.health * 2, 20, 220));\n    circle(this.position.x, this.position.y, this.radius * 2);\n  }\n\n  eat(foodPositions) {\n    for (let i = foodPositions.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      if (p5.Vector.dist(this.position, foodPositions[i]) < this.radius) {\n        this.health += 80;\n        foodPositions.splice(i, 1);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n\n  reproduce() {\n    if (random(1) < 0.0005) {\n      let childDNA = this.dna.copy();\n      childDNA.mutate(0.01);\n      return new Bloop(this.position, childDNA);\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n\n  dead() {\n    return this.health < 0;\n  }\n}\n\nclass Food {\n  constructor(count) {\n    this.positions = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < count; i++) this.add();\n  }\n\n  add(position = null) {\n    this.positions.push(position ? position.copy() : createVector(random(width), random(height)));\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    if (random(1) < 0.02) this.add();\n    fill(100);\n    noStroke();\n    for (let p of this.positions) square(p.x - 2, p.y - 2, 4);\n  }\n}\n\nclass World {\n  constructor(populationSize) {\n    this.bloops = [];\n    for (let i = 0; i < populationSize; i++) {\n      this.bloops.push(new Bloop(createVector(random(width), random(height))));\n    }\n    this.food = new Food(populationSize);\n  }\n\n  run() {\n    this.food.run();\n\n    for (let i = this.bloops.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n      let bloop = this.bloops[i];\n      bloop.run();\n      bloop.eat(this.food.positions);\n\n      if (bloop.dead()) {\n        this.food.add(bloop.position);\n        this.bloops.splice(i, 1);\n      } else {\n        let child = bloop.reproduce();\n        if (child) this.bloops.push(child);\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nclass BloopDNA {\n  constructor(genes = null) {\n    this.genes = genes ? genes.slice() : [random(1)];\n  }\n\n  copy() {\n    return new BloopDNA(this.genes);\n  }\n\n  mutate(rate) {\n    if (random(1) < rate) {\n      this.genes[0] = constrain(this.genes[0] + randomGaussian(0, 0.1), 0, 1);\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "10.1" :title "感知机" :chapter 10 :org "*** 示例 10.1: 感知机\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-10-1-perceptron\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 555-557\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 10.1, 感知机在训练过程中逐渐学会区分直线两侧的点. PDF 第 555 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-555-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet perceptron;\nlet training = [];\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction f(x) {\n  return 0.5 * x + 1;\n}\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  perceptron = new Perceptron(3, 0.0001);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 2000; i++) {\n    let x = random(-width / 2, width / 2);\n    let y = random(-height / 2, height / 2);\n    training[i] = [x, y, 1];\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  scale(1, -1);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  line(\n    -width / 2,\n    f(-width / 2),\n    width / 2,\n    f(width / 2)\n  );\n\n  let x = training[count][0];\n  let y = training[count][1];\n  let desired = y > f(x) ? 1 : -1;\n\n  perceptron.train(training[count], desired);\n  count = (count + 1) % training.length;\n\n  for (let dataPoint of training) {\n    let guess = perceptron.feedforward(dataPoint);\n    fill(guess > 0 ? 127 : 255);\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    circle(dataPoint[0], dataPoint[1], 8);\n  }\n}\n\nclass Perceptron {\n  constructor(totalInputs, learningConstant = 0.01) {\n    this.weights = [];\n    this.learningConstant = learningConstant;\n    for (let i = 0; i < totalInputs; i++) {\n      this.weights[i] = random(-1, 1);\n    }\n  }\n\n  feedforward(inputs) {\n    let sum = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.weights.length; i++) {\n      sum += inputs[i] * this.weights[i];\n    }\n    return sum > 0 ? 1 : -1;\n  }\n\n  train(inputs, desired) {\n    let guess = this.feedforward(inputs);\n    let error = desired - guess;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.weights.length; i++) {\n      this.weights[i] +=\n        error * inputs[i] * this.learningConstant;\n    }\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n示例中每一帧训练一个数据点. 灰色表示感知机预测 +1, 白色表示 -1. 权重并非神秘数字, 它们与决策边界的斜率和截距直接相关. 在更高维数据中, 权重定义的是高维空间里的超平面或更复杂决策边界.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let perceptron;\nlet training = [];\nlet count = 0;\n\nfunction f(x) {\n  return 0.5 * x + 1;\n}\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  perceptron = new Perceptron(3, 0.0001);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 2000; i++) {\n    let x = random(-width / 2, width / 2);\n    let y = random(-height / 2, height / 2);\n    training[i] = [x, y, 1];\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n  translate(width / 2, height / 2);\n  scale(1, -1);\n\n  stroke(0);\n  strokeWeight(2);\n  line(\n    -width / 2,\n    f(-width / 2),\n    width / 2,\n    f(width / 2)\n  );\n\n  let x = training[count][0];\n  let y = training[count][1];\n  let desired = y > f(x) ? 1 : -1;\n\n  perceptron.train(training[count], desired);\n  count = (count + 1) % training.length;\n\n  for (let dataPoint of training) {\n    let guess = perceptron.feedforward(dataPoint);\n    fill(guess > 0 ? 127 : 255);\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(1);\n    circle(dataPoint[0], dataPoint[1], 8);\n  }\n}\n\nclass Perceptron {\n  constructor(totalInputs, learningConstant = 0.01) {\n    this.weights = [];\n    this.learningConstant = learningConstant;\n    for (let i = 0; i < totalInputs; i++) {\n      this.weights[i] = random(-1, 1);\n    }\n  }\n\n  feedforward(inputs) {\n    let sum = 0;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.weights.length; i++) {\n      sum += inputs[i] * this.weights[i];\n    }\n    return sum > 0 ? 1 : -1;\n  }\n\n  train(inputs, desired) {\n    let guess = this.feedforward(inputs);\n    let error = desired - guess;\n    for (let i = 0; i < this.weights.length; i++) {\n      this.weights[i] +=\n        error * inputs[i] * this.learningConstant;\n    }\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "10.2" :title "手势分类器" :chapter 10 :org "*** 示例 10.2: 手势分类器\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-10-2-gesture-classifier\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 579-580\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 10.2, 拖动鼠标产生方向向量, 模型输出预测标签. 图中结果为 right. PDF 第 579 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-579-image-01.png]]\n\n下面给出完整可运行结构. 训练数据, 模型创建, 数据加入, 训练和部署均放在同一 sketch 中.\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet classifier;\nlet start;\nlet end;\nlet status = \"training\";\n\nlet data = [\n  { x: 0.99, y: 0.02, label: \"right\" },\n  { x: 0.76, y: -0.10, label: \"right\" },\n  { x: -1.00, y: 0.12, label: \"left\" },\n  { x: -0.90, y: -0.10, label: \"left\" },\n  { x: 0.02, y: 0.98, label: \"down\" },\n  { x: -0.20, y: 0.75, label: \"down\" },\n  { x: 0.01, y: -0.90, label: \"up\" },\n  { x: -0.10, y: -0.80, label: \"up\" }\n];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let options = {\n    task: \"classification\",\n    inputs: 2,\n    outputs: [\"up\", \"down\", \"left\", \"right\"],\n    debug: true\n  };\n\n  classifier = ml5.neuralNetwork(options);\n\n  for (let item of data) {\n    classifier.addData(\n      [item.x, item.y],\n      [item.label]\n    );\n  }\n\n  classifier.normalizeData();\n  classifier.train({ epochs: 200 }, finishedTraining);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  if (start && end) {\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(3);\n    line(start.x, start.y, end.x, end.y);\n  }\n\n  noStroke();\n  fill(0);\n  textAlign(CENTER, CENTER);\n  textSize(48);\n  text(status, width / 2, height / 2);\n}\n\nfunction finishedTraining() {\n  status = \"ready\";\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  start = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  end = start.copy();\n}\n\nfunction mouseDragged() {\n  end = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n}\n\nfunction mouseReleased() {\n  if (!start || !end) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(end, start);\n  if (dir.magSq() === 0) {\n    status = \"draw a gesture\";\n    return;\n  }\n\n  dir.normalize();\n  classifier.classify([dir.x, dir.y], gotResults);\n}\n\nfunction gotResults(error, results) {\n  if (error) {\n    console.error(error);\n    status = \"error\";\n    return;\n  }\n  status = results[0].label;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n若所用 ml5.js 版本只向回调传递 =results=, 可把函数改为:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction gotResults(results) {\n  status = results[0].label;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let classifier;\nlet start;\nlet end;\nlet status = \"training\";\n\nlet data = [\n  { x: 0.99, y: 0.02, label: \"right\" },\n  { x: 0.76, y: -0.10, label: \"right\" },\n  { x: -1.00, y: 0.12, label: \"left\" },\n  { x: -0.90, y: -0.10, label: \"left\" },\n  { x: 0.02, y: 0.98, label: \"down\" },\n  { x: -0.20, y: 0.75, label: \"down\" },\n  { x: 0.01, y: -0.90, label: \"up\" },\n  { x: -0.10, y: -0.80, label: \"up\" }\n];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  let options = {\n    task: \"classification\",\n    inputs: 2,\n    outputs: [\"up\", \"down\", \"left\", \"right\"],\n    debug: true\n  };\n\n  classifier = ml5.neuralNetwork(options);\n\n  for (let item of data) {\n    classifier.addData(\n      [item.x, item.y],\n      [item.label]\n    );\n  }\n\n  classifier.normalizeData();\n  classifier.train({ epochs: 200 }, finishedTraining);\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  if (start && end) {\n    stroke(0);\n    strokeWeight(3);\n    line(start.x, start.y, end.x, end.y);\n  }\n\n  noStroke();\n  fill(0);\n  textAlign(CENTER, CENTER);\n  textSize(48);\n  text(status, width / 2, height / 2);\n}\n\nfunction finishedTraining() {\n  status = \"ready\";\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  start = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n  end = start.copy();\n}\n\nfunction mouseDragged() {\n  end = createVector(mouseX, mouseY);\n}\n\nfunction mouseReleased() {\n  if (!start || !end) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let dir = p5.Vector.sub(end, start);\n  if (dir.magSq() === 0) {\n    status = \"draw a gesture\";\n    return;\n  }\n\n  dir.normalize();\n  classifier.classify([dir.x, dir.y], gotResults);\n}\n\nfunction gotResults(error, results) {\n  if (error) {\n    console.error(error);\n    status = \"error\";\n    return;\n  }\n  status = results[0].label;\n}\n"] ["javascript :eval never-export" "function gotResults(results) {\n  status = results[0].label;\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.1" :title "Flappy Bird 克隆" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.1: Flappy Bird 克隆\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-1-flappy-bird-clone\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 592-594\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.1, 由鼠标点击控制的小鸟穿越管道. 碰撞位置显示 OOPS!. PDF 第 593 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-593-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet bird;\nlet pipes = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  bird = new Bird();\n  pipes.push(new Pipe());\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  bird.flap();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = pipes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    pipes[i].show();\n    pipes[i].update();\n\n    if (pipes[i].collides(bird)) {\n      text(\"OOPS!\", pipes[i].x, pipes[i].top + 20);\n    }\n\n    if (pipes[i].offscreen()) {\n      pipes.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n\n  bird.update();\n  bird.show();\n\n  // 每 100 帧加入一根新管道.\n  if (frameCount % 100 === 0) {\n    pipes.push(new Pipe());\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n=p5.js= 的 =frameCount= 记录从 sketch 启动以来渲染的帧数. 取模运算符 =%= 返回除法余数. 表达式 =frameCount % 100 === 0= 每隔 100 帧为真, 因而可用于定期生成管道.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let bird;\nlet pipes = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  bird = new Bird();\n  pipes.push(new Pipe());\n}\n\nfunction mousePressed() {\n  bird.flap();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = pipes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    pipes[i].show();\n    pipes[i].update();\n\n    if (pipes[i].collides(bird)) {\n      text(\"OOPS!\", pipes[i].x, pipes[i].top + 20);\n    }\n\n    if (pipes[i].offscreen()) {\n      pipes.splice(i, 1);\n    }\n  }\n\n  bird.update();\n  bird.show();\n\n  // 每 100 帧加入一根新管道.\n  if (frameCount % 100 === 0) {\n    pipes.push(new Pipe());\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.2" :title "使用神经进化的 Flappy Bird" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.2: 使用神经进化的 Flappy Bird\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-2-flappy-bird-neuroevolution\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 603-604\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.2, 神经进化种群逐代学习控制拍翼时机. PDF 第 604 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-604-image-01.png]]\n\n每当全部小鸟死亡, 归一化适应度, 生成下一代并重置管道:\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nfunction draw() {\n  // 其余游戏更新和绘制代码.\n\n  if (allBirdsDead()) {\n    normalizeFitness();\n    reproduction();\n    resetPipes();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction resetPipes() {\n  // 只保留最新的一根管道, 防止新一代出生时立即碰撞.\n  pipes.splice(0, pipes.length - 1);\n}\n#+end_src\n\n在线完整版本还会在小鸟落地或飞出顶部时判定死亡. 如果不在换代时清理旧管道, 新生小鸟可能刚出现就与管道重叠, 再优秀的网络也没有机会展示能力.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "function draw() {\n  // 其余游戏更新和绘制代码.\n\n  if (allBirdsDead()) {\n    normalizeFitness();\n    reproduction();\n    resetPipes();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction resetPipes() {\n  // 只保留最新的一根管道, 防止新一代出生时立即碰撞.\n  pipes.splice(0, pipes.length - 1);\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.3" :title "使用神经进化的智能火箭" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.3: 使用神经进化的智能火箭\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-3-smart-rockets-neuroevolution\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 606-607\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.3, 以神经网络替代向量 DNA 的智能火箭. PDF 第 607 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-607-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nreproduction() {\n  let nextPopulation = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < this.population.length; i++) {\n    let parentA = this.weightedSelection();\n    let parentB = this.weightedSelection();\n    let child = parentA.crossover(parentB);\n    child.mutate(this.mutationRate);\n    nextPopulation[i] = new Rocket(320, 220, child);\n  }\n\n  this.population = nextPopulation;\n  this.generations++;\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "reproduction() {\n  let nextPopulation = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < this.population.length; i++) {\n    let parentA = this.weightedSelection();\n    let parentB = this.weightedSelection();\n    let child = parentA.crossover(parentB);\n    child.mutate(this.mutationRate);\n    nextPopulation[i] = new Rocket(320, 220, child);\n  }\n\n  this.population = nextPopulation;\n  this.generations++;\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.4" :title "动态神经进化转向" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.4: 动态神经进化转向\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-4-dynamic-neuroevolutionary-steering\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 611-612\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.4, 生物通过五个输入感知动态光球, 并用回归网络预测转向力. PDF 第 612 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-612-image-01.jpeg]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nclass Creature {\n  constructor(x, y, brain) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.r = 4;\n    this.maxspeed = 4;\n    this.fitness = 0;\n\n    if (brain) {\n      this.brain = brain;\n    } else {\n      this.brain = ml5.neuralNetwork({\n        inputs: 5,\n        outputs: 2,\n        task: \"regression\",\n        neuroEvolution: true\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  // seek() 使用前述五个输入预测转向力.\n  // update() 在接触 glow 时增加适应度.\n}\n#+end_src\n\n本书的写作和教学旅程跨越了十多年. 现在, 像一个曲折的随机游走终于使用 arrive 行为抵达目标, 最后一块拼图是把此前所有探索汇入自己的生态系统项目.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "class Creature {\n  constructor(x, y, brain) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.velocity = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.acceleration = createVector(0, 0);\n    this.r = 4;\n    this.maxspeed = 4;\n    this.fitness = 0;\n\n    if (brain) {\n      this.brain = brain;\n    } else {\n      this.brain = ml5.neuralNetwork({\n        inputs: 5,\n        outputs: 2,\n        task: \"regression\",\n        neuroEvolution: true\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  // seek() 使用前述五个输入预测转向力.\n  // update() 在接触 glow 时增加适应度.\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.5" :title "带传感器的 Bloop" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.5: 带传感器的 Bloop\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-5-bloop-sensors\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 616-618\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.5, 鼠标控制的 bloop 用一圈传感器探测食物. 传感器越接近食物中心, 端点显示越明显. PDF 第 617 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-617-image-01.png]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet bloop, food;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  bloop = new Creature(width / 2, height / 2);\n  food = new Food();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 暂时用鼠标控制 bloop.\n  bloop.position.x = mouseX;\n  bloop.position.y = mouseY;\n\n  food.show();\n  bloop.show();\n  bloop.sense(food);\n}\n\nclass Creature {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.r = 16;\n    this.sensors = [];\n\n    let totalSensors = 15;\n    for (let i = 0; i < totalSensors; i++) {\n      let a = map(i, 0, totalSensors, 0, TWO_PI);\n      let v = p5.Vector.fromAngle(a);\n      v.mult(this.r * 2);\n      this.sensors[i] = new Sensor(v);\n    }\n  }\n\n  sense(food) {\n    for (let sensor of this.sensors) {\n      sensor.sense(this.position, food);\n    }\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n\n    for (let sensor of this.sensors) {\n      stroke(0);\n      line(0, 0, sensor.v.x, sensor.v.y);\n\n      if (sensor.value > 0) {\n        fill(255, sensor.value * 255);\n        stroke(0, 100);\n        circle(sensor.v.x, sensor.v.y, 8);\n      }\n    }\n\n    noStroke();\n    fill(0);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let bloop, food;\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n  bloop = new Creature(width / 2, height / 2);\n  food = new Food();\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  // 暂时用鼠标控制 bloop.\n  bloop.position.x = mouseX;\n  bloop.position.y = mouseY;\n\n  food.show();\n  bloop.show();\n  bloop.sense(food);\n}\n\nclass Creature {\n  constructor(x, y) {\n    this.position = createVector(x, y);\n    this.r = 16;\n    this.sensors = [];\n\n    let totalSensors = 15;\n    for (let i = 0; i < totalSensors; i++) {\n      let a = map(i, 0, totalSensors, 0, TWO_PI);\n      let v = p5.Vector.fromAngle(a);\n      v.mult(this.r * 2);\n      this.sensors[i] = new Sensor(v);\n    }\n  }\n\n  sense(food) {\n    for (let sensor of this.sensors) {\n      sensor.sense(this.position, food);\n    }\n  }\n\n  show() {\n    push();\n    translate(this.position.x, this.position.y);\n\n    for (let sensor of this.sensors) {\n      stroke(0);\n      line(0, 0, sensor.v.x, sensor.v.y);\n\n      if (sensor.value > 0) {\n        fill(255, sensor.value * 255);\n        stroke(0, 100);\n        circle(sensor.v.x, sensor.v.y, 8);\n      }\n    }\n\n    noStroke();\n    fill(0);\n    circle(0, 0, this.r * 2);\n    pop();\n  }\n}\n"]]} {:id "11.6" :title "神经进化生态系统" :chapter 11 :org "*** 示例 11.6: 神经进化生态系统\n:PROPERTIES:\n:CUSTOM_ID: example-11-6-neuroevolutionary-ecosystem\n:PDF_PAGE_RANGE: 620-621\n:END:\n\n#+CAPTION: 示例 11.6, 具备局部传感器和神经网络大脑的 bloop 在连续生态系统中寻找食物, 消耗健康并繁殖. PDF 第 621 页精确提取.\n#+ATTR_ORG: :width 700\n[[file:images/pdf-page-621-image-01.jpeg]]\n\n#+begin_src javascript :eval never-export\nlet bloops = [];\nlet food = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n    bloops[i] = new Creature(random(width), random(height));\n  }\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n    food[i] = new Food();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = bloops.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    bloops[i].think();\n    bloops[i].eat(food);\n    bloops[i].update();\n    bloops[i].borders();\n\n    if (bloops[i].health < 0) {\n      bloops.splice(i, 1);\n    } else if (random(1) < 0.001) {\n      let child = bloops[i].reproduce();\n      bloops.push(child);\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (let treat of food) {\n    treat.show();\n  }\n\n  for (let bloop of bloops) {\n    bloop.show();\n  }\n}\n#+end_src\n\n在线完整示例还让食物在被吃时逐渐缩小, 耗尽后重新生成. Bloop 也会随健康下降而变小. 这些视觉变化帮助读者观察系统内部状态.\n\n" :code [["javascript :eval never-export" "let bloops = [];\nlet food = [];\n\nfunction setup() {\n  createCanvas(640, 240);\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 20; i++) {\n    bloops[i] = new Creature(random(width), random(height));\n  }\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 8; i++) {\n    food[i] = new Food();\n  }\n}\n\nfunction draw() {\n  background(255);\n\n  for (let i = bloops.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n    bloops[i].think();\n    bloops[i].eat(food);\n    bloops[i].update();\n    bloops[i].borders();\n\n    if (bloops[i].health < 0) {\n      bloops.splice(i, 1);\n    } else if (random(1) < 0.001) {\n      let child = bloops[i].reproduce();\n      bloops.push(child);\n    }\n  }\n\n  for (let treat of food) {\n    treat.show();\n  }\n\n  for (let bloop of bloops) {\n    bloop.show();\n  }\n}\n"]]}]
